        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.blizzard.desc", "When in a Snow biome during Rain, it will manifest as a Blizzard, causing increased snowfall.", "在下雨期间位于雪原生物群系中时，它会以暴雪的形式呈现，导致降雪量增加。");
