        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.eclipse.desc", "The Eclipse is a Hardmode event that can occasionally occur after at least one Mechanical Boss has been defeated. An Eclipse has a chance of occurring at any given dawn.", "日食是个困难模式事件，在至少有一个机械 Boss 被打败后会偶有发生。日食在任何特定黎明都有几率发生。");
