        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.frost_legion.desc", "The Frost Legion is a Hardmode invasion event that causes unique snowman enemies to spawn instead of regular enemies.", "雪人军团是一个困难模式入侵事件，会使得独特的雪人敌怪代替常规敌怪生成。");
