        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.goblin_invasion.desc", "The Goblin Army (also known as the Goblin Invasion) is an invasion event that causes unique Goblin enemies to spawn instead of regular enemies.", "哥布林军队（也称为哥布林入侵）是一个入侵事件，会使得独特的哥布林敌怪代替常规敌怪生成。");
