        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.hallow_cave_desert.desc", "The Hallow can spread through the Underground Desert, transforming it into a Hallow Cave Desert.", "神圣能够通过地下沙漠蔓延，将其转化为神圣洞穴沙漠。");
