        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.marble.desc", "The Marble Cave is a mini-biome that appears in the Cavern layer.", "大理石洞是一种出现在洞穴层的迷你生物群系。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.marble.title", "Marble", "大理石");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.martian_madness.desc", "Martian Madness is a Hardmode, post-Golem invasion event that causes unique alien-themed enemies to spawn instead of regular enemies.", "火星暴乱是一个困难模式、石巨人后的入侵事件，会使得独特的外星人主题的敌怪代替常规敌怪生成。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.martian_madness.title", "Martian Madness", "火星暴乱");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.meteor.desc", "The Meteor biome is a mini-biome that forms when a meteorite crashes into the world.", "陨石生物群系是一种迷你生物群系，形成于流星坠落在世界中时。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.meteor.title", "Meteor", "陨石");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.nebula_pillar.desc", "The Nebula Pillar is a magic-themed Celestial Pillar.", "星云柱是魔法主题的天界柱。");
