        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.snow.desc", "The Snow biome is a polar-themed surface biome.", "雪原生物群系，是一个以极地为主题的地表生物群系。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.snow.title", "Snow", "雪原");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.solar_pillar.desc", "The Solar Pillar is a melee-themed Celestial Pillar.", "日耀柱是近战主题的天界柱。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.solar_pillar.title", "Solar Pillar", "日耀柱");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.spider_nest.desc", "The Spider Nest, also known as the Spider Cave or Spider Den, is a mini-biome located in the Cavern layer.", "蜘蛛窝，也被称为蜘蛛洞或蜘蛛洞穴，是一种位于洞穴地层的迷你生物群系。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.spider_nest.title", "Spider Nest", "蜘蛛窝");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.stardust_pillar.desc", "The Stardust Pillar is a summoner-themed Celestial Pillar.", "星尘柱是召唤主题的天界柱。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.stardust_pillar.title", "Stardust Pillar", "星尘柱");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.surface.desc", "The Surface layer is located between y40 ~ y260.", "地表层位于y40~y260的位置");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.surface.title", "Surface", "地表");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.surface_mushroom.desc", "The Glowing Mushroom biome, also known as the Glowing Mushroom Fields, is a biome characterized by Mushroom Grass, Glowing Mushrooms, and giant Glowing Mushrooms that grow on mud blocks.", "发光蘑菇生物群系，也称为发光蘑菇地，这是一个以蘑菇草、发光蘑菇、和生长在泥块上的巨型发光蘑菇为特征的生物群系。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.surface_mushroom.title", "Surface Mushroom", "地表蘑菇");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_corruption.desc", "The Corruption is an evil biome with a theme of deep purple wasteland, death, and decay.", "腐化之地是一种邪恶生物群系，有着深紫色的废土、死亡、与腐烂的主题");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_corruption.title", "The Corruption", "腐化之地");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_crimson.desc", "The Crimson is an evil biome with a theme of fleshy infection and blood.", "猩红之地是一种邪恶生物群系，有着肉体感染的红色血腥主题");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_crimson.title", "The Crimson", "猩红之地");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_dungeon.desc", "The Dungeon is a massive underground brick maze.", "地牢是个巨大的地下砖制迷宫。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_dungeon.title", "The Dungeon", "地牢");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_hallow.desc", "The Hallow is a Hardmode surface biome characterized by its bright, fairy-tale imagery.", "神圣之地是一种困难模式中的地表生物群系。其特点是色彩鲜艳明快的童话图像。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_hallow.title", "The Hallow", "神圣之地");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_jungle.desc", "The Jungle is a surface biome primarily composed of grass, vines, mud, jungle trees, bamboo, and water pools.", "丛林是个主要由草、藤蔓、泥、丛林树、竹子和水塘组成的地表生物群系。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_jungle.title", "The Jungle", "丛林");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_nether.desc", "The Nether is the deepest layer in the world. It merges with the Underworld to form the Ash biome.", "地狱是世界中最深处的地层。与下界合并成为灰烬群系");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_nether.title", "The Nether", "地狱");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_temple.desc", "The Jungle Temple (also known as the Jungle Lizard Temple) is a closed structure located in the Underground Jungle, built from Jungle Lizard Bricks.", "丛林神庙（也被称为丛林蜥蜴神庙）是一个位于地下丛林的封闭式的结构，由丛林蜥蜴砖建成。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.the_temple.title", "The Temple", "神庙");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground.desc", "The Underground layer is located between y0 ~ y40.", "地下层位于y0~y40的位置");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground.title", "Underground", "地下");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_corruption.desc", "The Underground Corruption is a biome. It is the underground version of the surface Corruption, appearing from the Cavern layer and below.", "地下腐化之地是一个生物群系。它是地表层的腐化的地下版本，出现于洞穴地层及以下。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_corruption.title", "Underground Corruption", "地下腐化之地");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_crimson.desc", "The Underground Crimson is a biome. It is the underground version of the surface Crimson, appearing from the Cavern layer and below.", "地下猩红之地是一个生物群系。它是地表层的猩红的地下版本，出现于洞穴地层及以下。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_crimson.title", "Underground Crimson", "地下猩红之地");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_desert.desc", "The Underground Desert is a biome located directly beneath the world's main Desert.", "地下沙漠是位于世界的主沙漠正下方的生物群系。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_desert.title", "Underground Desert", "地下沙漠");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_hallow.desc", "The Underground Hallow is the underground version of the surface Hallow, appearing from the Cavern layer and below.", "地下神圣之地是地表层神圣的地下版本，出现在洞穴层及更下方。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_hallow.title", "Underground Hallow", "地下神圣之地");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_jungle.desc", "The Underground Jungle is a dense network of small caves, primarily composed of mud, water pools, spiky bushes, and hive traps. It lies beneath the surface Jungle biome and extends into the Cavern layer.", "地下丛林是密集的小洞穴网络，主要由泥、水塘、多刺灌木、和蜂巢机关组成。它位于地表的丛林生物群系下面并延伸至洞穴层。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_jungle.title", "Underground Jungle", "地下丛林");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_mushroom.desc", "The Glowing Mushroom biome, also known as the Glowing Mushroom Fields, is a biome characterized by Mushroom Grass, Glowing Mushrooms, and giant Glowing Mushrooms that grow on mud blocks.", "发光蘑菇生物群系，也称为发光蘑菇地，这是一个以蘑菇草、发光蘑菇、和生长在泥块上的巨型发光蘑菇为特征的生物群系。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.underground_mushroom.title", "Underground Mushroom", "地下蘑菇");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.vortex_pillar.desc", "The Vortex Pillar is a ranged-themed Celestial Pillar.", "星旋柱是远程主题的天界柱。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.vortex_pillar.title", "Vortex Pillar", "星旋柱");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.windy_day.desc", "A Windy Day is an event that occurs when the wind speed exceeds 20 mph.", "大风天是当风速超过 20 mph 时发生的一个事件。");
        language.add("bestiary.confluence.filter.windy_day.title", "Windy Day", "大风天");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.anger_bones.desc", "Cursed with undeath, the former inhabitants of the Dungeon roam endlessly through its halls, seeking a victim for their unending fury.", "愤怒骷髅怪是受不死诅咒的原地牢居民，在地牢大厅中永无休止地游荡，寻找宣泄无尽怒火的目标。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.anger_goblin.desc", "This type of goblin seethes with a warrior god's wrath, boasting formidable strength.", "这种哥布林疑似带着战神般的愤怒，实力强悍。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.angler.desc", "The Angler, a rude fishing genius, sends others to find weird, rare fish. He rewards random items, entertained by any misfortunes.", "渔夫是粗鲁的钓鱼天才，叫人去寻找稀有怪鱼。他会随机奖励物品，从他人的不幸中取乐。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.angler_fish.desc", "Some angler fish are content to lie in wait for their prey, but these are perfectly happy to aggressively chase down an underwater meal.", "有些琵琶鱼喜欢埋伏等待猎物上门，而这类琵琶鱼则热衷于主动追击水下的猎物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.angry_dandelion.desc", "All this wind can make just about anyone angry. Evidently, this includes otherwise harmless dandelions and their deadly seeds.", "强风足以让几乎所有生物烦躁，显然，原本无害的蒲公英也不例外——它们会射出致命的种子。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.angry_nimbus.desc", "When severe storms roll through, it is said that the skies are angry. This cloud in particular is especially livid!", "据说暴风雨来临时，天空会“发怒”，而这团愤怒雨云怪的“怒气”尤为强烈！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.angry_tumbler.desc", "Powerful winds have blown this tumbleweed around the desert, and it is none too pleased. They roll faster with the wind than against it.", "这团风滚草被强风吹得在沙漠里四处翻滚，早已满心怒火。它顺风滚动的速度远快于逆风时。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.antlion.desc", "When antlions are nesting, they hide in the surface. To defend their eggs, they projectile vomit hard globs of sand at trespassers.", "蚁狮筑巢时会潜藏在地表之下，若有入侵者威胁到它们的卵，便会喷射坚硬的沙团进行反击。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.antlion_charger.desc", "The soldiers of the antlion species, Antlion Chargers ferociously chase after intruders with a surprising speed.", "蚁狮马是蚁狮族群的士兵，会以惊人的速度凶猛地追击入侵者。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.antlion_larva.desc", "Freshly hatched from their eggs, larval antlions should not be underestimated. Though young, they are still very aggressive.", "刚从卵中孵化的蚁狮幼虫绝不可轻视，即便尚处幼年，它们的攻击性也极强。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.antlion_swarmer.desc", "Antlion Swarmers patrol their nests with a watchful eye. Should anyone threaten their eggs, they will defend them fiercely.", "蚁狮蜂会警惕地巡视巢穴，一旦有人威胁到它们的卵，便会拼死守护。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.arapaima.desc", "These enormous fish thrive in the jungle waters near veins of unstable magicks, which make them unusually strong and hostile.", "巨骨舌鱼在靠近不稳定魔法矿脉的丛林水域中生存，这种环境让它们变得异常强壮且充满敌意。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.armored_skeleton.desc", "Remnants of a long lost expeditionary force, these stout warriors mindlessly patrol the caves in which they died.", "装甲骷髅是早已覆灭的远征军残部，这些顽强的战士会在自己战死的洞穴中漫无目的地巡逻。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.armored_viking.desc", "The most elite vikings were worthy of the strongest armor. It seems that it wasn't terribly effective, given their state now.", "最精锐的维京人本该配得上最坚固的盔甲，但从他们如今的亡灵模样来看，这盔甲显然没起到多大作用。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.arms_dealer.desc", "The Arms Dealer has everything anyone could need to shoot things dead, from little round bullets to guns made from sharks.", "军火商拥有所有致命武器，小到一枚子弹，大到用鲨鱼制成的枪炮。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.basilisk.desc", "Sturdy as a rock, these lizard-like beasts roam the desert in search of food. Their hardened bodies make them formidable threats.", "蛇蜥怪如岩石般坚固，这类蜥蜴状生物在沙漠中搜寻猎物，坚硬的躯体让它们成为难以对付的威胁。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.big_anger_bones.desc", "Cursed with undeath, the former inhabitants of the Dungeon roam endlessly through its halls, seeking a victim for their unending fury.", "大型愤怒骷髅怪是受不死诅咒的原地牢居民，在地牢大厅中永无休止地游荡，寻找宣泄无尽怒火的目标。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.big_bones.desc", "Cursed with undeath, the former inhabitants of the Dungeon roam endlessly through its halls, seeking a victim for their unending fury.", "大骷髅是受不死诅咒的原地牢居民，在地牢大厅中永无休止地游荡，寻找宣泄无尽怒火的目标。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.big_helmet_anger_bones.desc", "Cursed with undeath, the former inhabitants of the Dungeon roam endlessly through its halls, seeking a victim for their unending fury.", "戴大头盔的愤怒骷髅怪是受不死诅咒的原地牢居民，在地牢大厅中永无休止地游荡，寻找宣泄无尽怒火的目标。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.big_muscle_anger_bones.desc", "Cursed with undeath, the former inhabitants of the Dungeon roam endlessly through its halls, seeking a victim for their unending fury.", "大块头愤怒骷髅怪是受不死诅咒的原地牢居民，在地牢大厅中永无休止地游荡，寻找宣泄无尽怒火的目标。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.bird.desc", "A simple white bird which enjoys a calm sunny day.", "普通的白色小鸟，喜欢风和日丽的好天气。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.black_recluse.desc", "They have eight legs, eight eyes, and eight ways to cocoon and feast upon an unsuspecting victim.", "黑隐士有八条腿、八只眼，更有八种方法将毫无防备的受害者缠入茧中享用。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.black_slime.desc", "A simple, gelatinous creature that swallows anything and everything whole! It takes a long time to digest anything.", "黑史莱姆是简单的胶状生物，见到任何东西都会整个吞下！但消化过程需要很长时间。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.blood_crawler.desc", "Most spiders operate independently, but ones touched by the Crimson hive coordinate together to consume life.", "血爬虫是受猩红巢穴影响的蜘蛛，与普通蜘蛛的独立行动不同，它们会协同作战，共同蚕食生命。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.blood_jelly.desc", "Jellyfish swimming in the bloody waters of the Crimson become infected, converting them to its all-consuming cause.", "血水母原本是普通水母，在猩红之地的血腥水域中被感染，沦为猩红力量的傀儡，参与到吞噬一切的行动中。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.blood_mummy.desc", "The blood-dripping organic matter in these mummies display far better preservation than the rest of their ilk.", "血木乃伊的躯体中残留着大量滴血的有机物，与其他木乃伊相比，这些有机物的保存状态要好得多。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.blood_zombie.desc", "With enough exposure to a Blood Moon, zombies become twisted and cursed with everflowing blood pouring out from their rotten flesh.", "长时间暴露在血月下，僵尸会发生扭曲并被诅咒，腐烂的肉体中不断涌出鲜血。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.bloody_spore.desc", "The Crimson recognizes that Creepers are the easiest creatures to spread its flesh.", "猩红之地知道苦力怕这种生物最容易将它的肉体撒播。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.blue_jay.desc", "This little blue bird came looking for worms.", "这只蓝色的小鸟是来捉蠕虫的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.blue_jellyfish.desc", "That strange tingling sensation in the water may be the unwelcome surging of electrical death from a brainless jellyfish. Swim with care.", "水中若出现奇怪的刺痛感，可能是无脑的蓝水母释放的致命电流所致，游泳时务必小心。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.blue_slime.desc", "A simple, gelatinous creature that swallows anything and everything whole! It takes a long time to digest anything.", "蓝史莱姆是简单的胶状生物，见到任何东西都会整个吞下！但消化过程需要很长时间。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.bone_biter.desc", "In ancient times, a saltwater river once ran through the desert. These powerful creatures evolved to survive in the now dry sand.", "噬骨沙鲨的祖先生活在远古时期流经沙漠的咸水河中，如今已进化出在干燥沙漠中生存的能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.bone_serpent.desc", "Mighty serpentine dragons once ruled hell, but long ago shed their obsidian scales. A skeletal husk is all that remains.", "曾有威猛的蛇形巨龙统治地狱，但很久以前它们便蜕去了黑曜石龙鳞，如今仅剩下一具具骨骼残骸，化为骨蛇游荡。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.brain_of_cthulhu.desc", "A piece of Cthulhu torn asunder, this vile mastermind pulses with agony and aids the Crimson in an attempt to avenge its master.", "克苏鲁之脑是从克苏鲁身上撕裂下的部分，这个邪恶的主脑在痛苦中搏动，试图通过协助猩红之地，为自己的主人复仇。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.brain_scrambler.desc", "A Martian gunner whose bolts scramble the victim's sense of direction.", "其弹丸会扰乱受害者方向感的火星枪手。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.buggy.desc", "A vibrant beetle-like bug. Fish are extremely attracted to these.", "蚜虫是一种色彩鲜艳的甲虫类昆虫。它们对鱼儿有着极强的吸引力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.bunny.desc", "Fuzzy wuzzy creatures that prefer safe, friendly locations.", "兔兔是毛茸茸的小家伙，偏爱安全、友善的环境。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.butterfly.gold.desc", "Rarely, critters are found coated entirely in gold! They are worth great coin to shopkeepers and fish absolutely love golden bait!", "罕见情况下，有些小动物会全身覆金！店主们会出高价收购，而且鱼儿超爱金色的鱼饵！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.butterfly.julia.desc", "Beautiful fluttering insects that love sunrises. Fish are attracted to these based on their color variety.", "蝴蝶是喜爱日出的美丽昆虫，它们色彩多样，连鱼儿都会被吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.butterfly.monarch.desc", "Beautiful fluttering insects that love sunrises. Fish are attracted to these based on their color variety.", "蝴蝶是喜爱日出的美丽昆虫，它们色彩多样，连鱼儿都会被吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.butterfly.purple_emperor.desc", "Beautiful fluttering insects that love sunrises. Fish are attracted to these based on their color variety.", "蝴蝶是喜爱日出的美丽昆虫，它们色彩多样，连鱼儿都会被吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.butterfly.red_admiral.desc", "Beautiful fluttering insects that love sunrises. Fish are attracted to these based on their color variety.", "蝴蝶是喜爱日出的美丽昆虫，它们色彩多样，连鱼儿都会被吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.butterfly.sulphur.desc", "Beautiful fluttering insects that love sunrises. Fish are attracted to these based on their color variety.", "蝴蝶是喜爱日出的美丽昆虫，它们色彩多样，连鱼儿都会被吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.butterfly.tree_nymph.desc", "Beautiful fluttering insects that love sunrises. Fish are attracted to these based on their color variety.", "蝴蝶是喜爱日出的美丽昆虫，它们色彩多样，连鱼儿都会被吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.butterfly.ulysses.desc", "Beautiful fluttering insects that love sunrises. Fish are attracted to these based on their color variety.", "蝴蝶是喜爱日出的美丽昆虫，它们色彩多样，连鱼儿都会被吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.butterfly.zebra_swallowtail.desc", "Beautiful fluttering insects that love sunrises. Fish are attracted to these based on their color variety.", "蝴蝶是喜爱日出的美丽昆虫，它们色彩多样，连鱼儿都会被吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.cardinal.desc", "A rare, red-crested friend of the forest.", "红雀是罕见的红冠鸟类，堪称森林的好朋友。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.cave_bat.desc", "They are small, hard to see, and swiftly flap about in unpredictable ways. They often carry diseases, such as rabies.", "洞穴蝙蝠体型小巧，难以察觉，飞行轨迹变幻莫测，还常携带狂犬病等疾病。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.chaos_elemental.desc", "Once living beings infused by the blessing, they erratically make chase with an uncontrollable surge of luminous power.", "混沌精原本是普通生物，受神圣福佑注入后发生异变，会携带着难以控制的发光能量，疯狂追逐周围的活物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.clinger.desc", "In the depths of the darkest corruption lies cursed-fire belching, betentacled nightmares stretching from the very walls themselves.", "在最黑暗的腐化之地深处，栖息着爬藤怪这种恐怖生物——它们长有触手，能从岩壁中延伸而出，还会喷射诅咒火焰。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.clothier.desc", "Once trapped under a curse, the Clothier is the master of thread. If it's fashion that's desired, he's the man! He talks in a familiar way.", "服装商曾被诅咒所困，是当之无愧的针线大师。若你追求时尚，找他准没错！他说话的语气十分随和。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.clumsy_slime.desc", "This slime was a little confused when the other slimes started putting on hats and accessories. But it did its best.", "当其他史莱姆开始戴帽子、配饰品时，笨拙史莱姆还一脸困惑。但它已经尽力去跟上大家了。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.cool_slime.desc", "Easily the coolest slime around, no question. You can tell from the backwards hat and indecipherable slang.", "酷酷史莱姆无疑是最“酷”的史莱姆，这点毫无争议。从它反戴的帽子和让人摸不着头脑的俚语就能看出来。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.corrupt_bunny.desc", "Bunnies are pure beings that normally resist all forms of Corruption, but will succumb under the effects of a Blood Moon.", "兔兔本是纯洁的生物，通常能抵抗各种腐化力量，但在血月影响下会屈服。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.corrupt_goldfish.desc", "Goldfish mutate and become violent when exposed to a Blood Moon, allowing the Corruption to take hold of them.", "金鱼在血月影响下会发生变异，变得狂暴并被腐化力量控制。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.corrupt_mimic.desc", "Mimics which fall to Corruption grow larger and more powerful as a result. They can be birthed from ordinary chests by force.", "落入腐化之地的宝箱怪会进化为腐化宝箱怪，体型与实力大幅提升。通过外力作用，也能从普通宝箱中强制催生它们。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.corrupt_penguin.desc", "During a Blood Moon, the normally docile penguins fall under the hostile influence of the Corruption.", "血月期间，原本温顺的企鹅会受到腐化力量的敌意影响，变得极具攻击性。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.corrupt_slime.desc", "Steeped in the power of Corruption, these slimes can survive being cut apart into smaller pieces, unlike their untainted brethren.", "腐化史莱姆被腐化之力深度浸染，与未受污染的同类不同，即便被切割成小块，每一部分都能独立存活。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.crab.desc", "This hard shelled coastal creature could snip the toes right off a man, among other things. They are not to be trifled with.", "这种生活在海岸的硬壳生物，能轻易剪断人的脚趾，甚至造成更严重的伤害，绝不可轻视。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.crawdad.desc", "A subterranean form of crayfish which scuttles along the cavern floors, searching for prey to clip apart with its powerful pincers.", "龙虾是生活在地下的螯虾品种，会沿着洞穴地面快速爬行，用有力的螯钳将猎物撕碎。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.crimera.desc", "The most common horror to be born from the Crimson, it seeks to consume pure things with unrelenting hunger.", "猩红喀迈拉是猩红之地最常见的恐怖造物，始终被无尽的饥饿驱使，执着于吞噬纯净的生命与物体。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.crimson_mimic.desc", "Mimics which are enthralled by the Crimson are empowered dramatically. They can be birthed from ordinary chests by force.", "被猩红之力蛊惑的宝箱怪会进化为猩红宝箱怪，实力得到显著增强。通过外力作用，也能从普通宝箱中强制催生它们。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.crimson_slime.desc", "Taking on the consistency of congealed blood and flesh, Crimslimes seek out and digest more raw material for the Crimson.", "猩红史莱姆的躯体由凝结的血肉构成，会主动寻找并吞噬生物，为猩红之地提供更多扩张所需的原材料。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.crystal_thresher.desc", "In ancient times, a saltwater river once ran through the desert. These powerful creatures evolved to survive in the now dry sand.", "水晶沙鲨的祖先生活在远古时期流经沙漠的咸水河中，如今已进化出在干燥沙漠中生存的能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.cursed_skull.desc", "Exposed to dark rituals, this skull has begun floating around on its own, chasing the living. Its touch leaves its victims defenseless.", "受黑暗仪式影响，这颗诅咒骷髅头已能自行漂浮移动，主动追逐活物。一旦被它触碰，受害者将失去所有防御能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.cyborg.desc", "The Cyborg was built with the combined efforts of the Mechanic and the Steampunker to aid in rocket science and world defense.", "机器侠是机械师与蒸汽朋克人联手打造的产物，旨在为火箭研发与世界防御提供助力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dark_caster.desc", "Doomed to watch over the Dungeon, these mages teleport to confuse their prey, before striking them down with a blast of water.", "暗黑法师注定要看守地牢，它们会通过瞬移迷惑猎物，随后用一股水流击倒对方。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dark_lamia.desc", "By the time glowing red eyes appear in the darkness of the desert caves, it is already too late. The lamias have found their prey.", "当沙漠洞穴的黑暗中出现发光的红色眼眸时，一切都已太晚——拉弥亚早已锁定了自己的猎物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dark_mummy.desc", "With the sands transmogrified by outside forces, those put to rest in the desert, whether good or evil, now rise to maim and kill.", "暗黑木乃伊原本是安息在沙漠中的逝者，受外界力量改变沙漠形态的影响，无论生前善恶，如今都化为亡灵苏醒，肆意残杀。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.decayeder.desc", "Skeletons reanimated by the Corrupted; fragile yet adept at spreading evil thoughts.", "被腐化之地重组的骸骨，脆弱但是擅长传播邪念。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.deerclops.desc", "Hailing from a distant land, this cyclopic monstrosity lurks in cold places, wreaking havoc on those who disturb it.", "这只独眼巨兽来自遥远的地方，它蛰伏在酷寒之处，给打扰它的人带去灭顶之灾。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demolitionist.desc", "Tread carefully around this dwarf. The Demolitionist is an explosive fanatic and sells dangerous things that go 'Boom!'", "在这个矮人周围要小心。爆破专家痴迷于炸药，兜售的都是会“砰！”的危险物品。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon.desc", "Demons are the infantry of the underworld. Unlike their lesser brothers, they cast shadow magic rather than hell magic.", "恶魔是地狱的主力步兵，与火焰小鬼等低级同类不同，它们掌握的是暗影魔法，而非基础的地狱火焰魔法。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.cataract.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's aged minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的老仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.cataract_big.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's large, aged minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的大型老仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.dilated.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's dilated minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的涣散仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.dilated_small.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's small, dilated minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的涣散小仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.green.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's green minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的绿色仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.green_small.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's small, green minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的绿色小仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.normal.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.normal_big.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's big minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的大仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.owl_mask.desc", "No one knows who dressed these demon eyes up in cute costumes, but the whole process hasn't made them any friendlier.", "恶魔眼（猫头鹰面具）没人知道是谁用可爱服装打扮了这些恶魔眼，但这番装扮丝毫没有让它们变得更友善。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.purple.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's purple minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的紫色仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.purple_big.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's big, purple minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的紫色大仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.sleepy.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's sleepy minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的瞌睡仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.sleepy_big.desc", "That unsettling feeling of being watched may very well be real in the dead of night, when Cthulhu's big, sleepy minions hover through the skies.", "当克苏鲁的大瞌睡仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.demon_eye.spaceship.desc", "No one knows who dressed these demon eyes up in cute costumes, but the whole process hasn't made them any friendlier.", "恶魔眼（太空船）没人知道是谁用可爱服装打扮了这些恶魔眼，但这番装扮丝毫没有让它们变得更友善。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.derpling.desc", "These large, sapphire-shelled fleas leap around incessantly. They can drain the blood content of one man within seconds.", "这些身披蓝宝石色外壳的巨型跳蚤，会不停地跳跃移动，短短几秒内就能吸干一个人的血液。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.desert_slime.desc", "Deserts are very dry, but the Sand Slime seems to have successfully adapted to the harsh conditions by becoming a pile of living sand.", "沙漠环境极度干旱，而沙史莱姆通过化为一团“活沙”，成功适应了这种恶劣条件。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.desert_spirit.desc", "Ancient magicks corrupted the minds of the once friendly desert djinns, releasing them full of hostility from their lamps.", "沙漠幽魂原本是友善的沙漠精灵，受远古魔法影响心智被腐化，从神灯中挣脱而出，变得充满敌意。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.devourer.desc", "Worm-like monstrosities are the Corruption's most favored creatures, tunneling underneath unsuspecting victims.", "吞噬怪是形似蠕虫的恐怖生物，也是腐化之地最青睐的造物，常会在毫无防备的受害者脚下挖掘通道，发动突袭。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.digger.desc", "Exposure to the effects of ancient magicks flowing throughout the cracks of the world causes unusual rapid growths in giant worms.", "受遍布世界裂缝的远古魔法影响，巨型蠕虫会发生异常的快速生长，形成挖掘怪。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.diva_slime.desc", "Born of the combined energies of Shimmer and the Queen Slime, this slime is full of boundless energy and enthusiasm! And so fancy!", "天后史莱姆由微光与史莱姆皇后的能量融合而生，充满了无限活力与热情！而且模样格外精致！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.doctor_bones.desc", "This particular zombie has a knack for finding historical artifacts, but has a terrible disdain towards snakes.", "骷髅博士这个特殊的僵尸，擅长寻找历史文物，却对蛇类有着极大的厌恶。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dragonfly.black.desc", "A swift-flying insect which hunts mosquitoes. Comes in a variety of colors. Fish are somewhat attracted to these.", "蜻蜓飞行速度快，以蚊子为食，有多种颜色。鱼儿多少会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dragonfly.blue.desc", "A swift-flying insect which hunts mosquitoes. Comes in a variety of colors. Fish are somewhat attracted to these.", "蜻蜓飞行速度快，以蚊子为食，有多种颜色。鱼儿多少会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dragonfly.gold.desc", "Rarely, critters are found coated entirely in gold! They are worth great coin to shopkeepers and fish absolutely love golden bait!", "罕见情况下，有些小动物会全身覆金！店主们会出高价收购，而且鱼儿超爱金色的鱼饵！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dragonfly.green.desc", "A swift-flying insect which hunts mosquitoes. Comes in a variety of colors. Fish are somewhat attracted to these.", "蜻蜓飞行速度快，以蚊子为食，有多种颜色。鱼儿多少会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dragonfly.orange.desc", "A swift-flying insect which hunts mosquitoes. Comes in a variety of colors. Fish are somewhat attracted to these.", "蜻蜓飞行速度快，以蚊子为食，有多种颜色。鱼儿多少会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dragonfly.red.desc", "A swift-flying insect which hunts mosquitoes. Comes in a variety of colors. Fish are somewhat attracted to these.", "蜻蜓飞行速度快，以蚊子为食，有多种颜色。鱼儿多少会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dragonfly.yellow.desc", "A swift-flying insect which hunts mosquitoes. Comes in a variety of colors. Fish are somewhat attracted to these.", "蜻蜓飞行速度快，以蚊子为食，有多种颜色。鱼儿多少会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dreamer_ghoul.desc", "Ghouls cleansed by the Hallow possess a psychedelic saliva that renders their victims confused and distracted by visions and mirages.", "神梦食尸鬼被神圣之地净化后，唾液带有迷幻效果，能让受害者产生幻象，陷入困惑并分散注意力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.drippler.desc", "Demon eyes become erratic under a Blood Moon, sometimes twisting together into a dripping cluster of cursed blood and eyeballs.", "血月期间，恶魔眼会变得异常，有时会缠绕在一起，形成由被诅咒的血液和眼球组成的滴血团块——这就是滴滴怪。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dryad.desc", "The Dryad is the last of her kind. She is connected with nature and can analyze its purity worldwide. She sells seeds, too!", "树妖是她的同族中最后一人了。她与大自然紧密相连，可以分析世界各地的自然纯净度。她还售卖种子！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.duck.common.desc", "A white feathered waterfowl that swims in pure water and basks in the warm sun.", "鸭子是白色羽毛的水禽，喜欢在纯净的水中游动，沐浴温暖的阳光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.duck.mallard.desc", "A water fowl with beautiful plumage. Swims in the purest of water, quacking happily.", "野鸭是拥有漂亮羽毛的水禽，喜欢在最纯净的水中游动，还会欢快地嘎嘎叫。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dungeon_guardian.desc", "A lethal sentry that stands watch over the Dungeon's gates. Those who are deemed unworthy to enter shall not pass!", "地牢守卫是镇守地牢大门的致命哨兵，任何被判定为“无资格进入”的生物，都绝无可能通过它的防线！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dungeon_slime.desc", "Slimes in the Dungeon became powerful by feeding off the cursed energy throughout the place. They seem particularly attracted to keys.", "地牢史莱姆通过吸收地牢中的诅咒能量变得强大，且似乎对钥匙有着特殊的吸引力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dungeon_spirit.desc", "Sometimes, highly concentrated ectoplasm gathers inside the more powerful of the cursed inhabitants of the Dungeon.", "在地牢中，部分实力较强的被诅咒住民体内，有时会聚集起高浓度的灵气，最终化为地牢幽魂。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.dye_trader.desc", "Eccentric and rather snobby to a fault, the Dye Trader has expensive tastes. He is passionate about the materials used in the dyes he sells.", "染料商古怪且势利到极点，他有着奢侈的爱好。他对自己销售的染料所用的材料很感兴趣。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.eater_of_souls.desc", "Birthed from the Corruption as a being of pure malice, its sole instincts are to pursue, punish, and kill.", "噬魂怪诞生于腐化之地，是纯粹由恶意构成的生物，其唯一本能便是追逐、惩罚并杀戮一切活物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.eater_of_worlds.desc", "Conceived from the bottomless malice of the Corruption, this mighty abyssal worm tunnels wildly to devour all in its path.", "世界吞噬怪由腐化之地无底的恶意孕育而成，这只强大的深渊蠕虫会疯狂挖掘通道，吞噬沿途所有事物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.elder_slime.desc", "Older, though not necessarily wiser, the other slimes look up to the Elder Slime. If it survived this long, it must know something!", "长者史莱姆年纪更大，却未必更聪明，但其他史莱姆都很敬重它。能活这么久，它肯定有过人之处！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.explosive_bunny.desc", "Not the typical garden-variety bunny. This one has been tampered with, and has an explosive temper as a result.", "爆炸兔可不是普通的田园兔子，它被人动过手脚，脾气火爆得很。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.eye_of_cthulhu.desc", "A piece of Cthulhu ripped from his body centuries ago in a bloody war. It wanders the night seeking its host body... and revenge!", "克苏鲁之眼是数个世纪前的血战中，从克苏鲁身上撕裂下的器官，它在夜间游荡，寻找自己的本体……并伺机复仇！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.face_monster.desc", "It would be unwise to face off with one of these unfeeling, hungry mutations. Their mouths are large enough to devour all things.", "脸怪是无情且贪婪的变异生物，与它们正面抗衡绝非明智之举——其嘴巴大到足以吞噬任何眼前的事物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.fairy.blue.desc", "Glowing winged humanoid creatures the size of a butterfly. Attuned to the world around them, they excel at finding shiny things.", "蓝仙灵是蝴蝶大小的发光有翼人形生物，能与周围环境相融，擅长寻找闪亮的物品。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.fairy.green.desc", "Glowing winged humanoid creatures the size of a butterfly. Attuned to the world around them, they excel at finding shiny things.", "绿仙灵是蝴蝶大小的发光有翼人形生物，能与周围环境相融，擅长寻找闪亮的物品。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.fairy.pink.desc", "Glowing winged humanoid creatures the size of a butterfly. Attuned to the world around them, they excel at finding shiny things.", "粉仙灵是蝴蝶大小的发光有翼人形生物，能与周围环境相融，擅长寻找闪亮的物品。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.fealing.desc", "These scintillating fairy-like creatures are born when animals wander into the glowing depths of a Shimmer pond.", "当动物误入微光池塘发光的深处时，就会孕育出飞灵这种闪闪发光、形似仙灵的生物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.fire_imp.desc", "A lesser demon imbued with hell magic. Capable of teleporting and hurling phantom fireballs towards their foes.", "火焰小鬼是蕴含地狱魔法的低级恶魔，既能施展瞬移躲避攻击，又能向敌人投掷幻影火球造成伤害。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.firefly.desc", "Appears at night in calm locations, illuminating the sky with strobing green light. Fish are fairly attracted to these.", "在宁静地点的夜间出现，以闪烁的绿光照亮天空，对鱼有较强吸引力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.flesh_reaver.desc", "In ancient times, a saltwater river once ran through the desert. These powerful creatures evolved to survive in the now dry sand.", "戮血沙鲨的祖先生活在远古时期流经沙漠的咸水河中，如今已进化出在干燥沙漠中生存的能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.flying_fish.desc", "Certain species of fish gain the most peculiar abilities when it rains. They only like one thing about land-dwellers: their flesh.", "某些鱼类在雨天会获得奇特的能力。对于陆地上的生物，它们只对一样东西感兴趣——血肉。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.fungi_bulb.desc", "When the glowing fungus is ready to spread, these bulbs will sprout to spread its spores to other locations and hosts.", "当发光真菌准备扩散时，真菌球怪便会生长成熟，将孢子传播到其他区域和宿主身上，助力真菌繁衍。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.fungo_fish.desc", "Glowing mushroom spores have transformed this aquatic creature into a softly glowing, jellyfish-like hybrid.", "发光蘑菇的孢子让这种水生生物变成了水母般的混合体，在幽深的水中散发柔光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ghost.desc", "During the most harrowing times, these apparitions float aimlessly through the depths to steal the life from those they envy.", "在最痛苦的时刻，这些鬼魂会在深处漫无目的地飘荡，从自己嫉妒的生灵身上窃取生命。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ghoul.desc", "Wandering the dark caverns below the desert dunes, ghouls are the dessicated husks of zombies preserved by the arid environment.", "食尸鬼是被干旱环境保存下来的干枯僵尸躯壳，在沙丘之下的黑暗洞穴中四处游荡。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.giant_antlion_swarmer.desc", "Antlion Swarmers patrol their nests with a watchful eye. Should anyone threaten their eggs, they will defend them fiercely.", "巨型蚁狮蜂会警惕地巡视巢穴，一旦有人威胁到它们的卵，便会拼死守护。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.giant_bat.desc", "The oversized cousins of Cave Bats, these bats are more dangerous and can confuse their enemies with their bite.", "巨型蝙蝠是洞穴蝙蝠的体型更大的近亲，它们更危险，叮咬还会让敌人陷入混乱。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.giant_fungi_bulb.desc", "当发光真菌准备扩散时，巨型真菌球怪便会生长成熟，将孢子传播到其他区域和宿主身上，助力真菌繁衍。", "当发光真菌准备扩散时，巨型真菌球怪便会生长成熟，将孢子传播到其他区域和宿主身上，助力真菌繁衍。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.giant_shelly.desc", "To overcome their slow speed, shellies have developed the ability to hide inside their spiked shell and hurl themselves at their foes.", "为了弥补速度慢的缺点，巨型卷壳怪进化出了躲进尖壳中，然后向敌人猛冲的能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.giant_worm.desc", "These itty bitty diggy dawgs dig through the earth and take focused spelunkers by surprise, causing unwanted distress.", "巨型蠕虫这些“小土拨鼠”会在地下挖掘隧道，突然袭击专注探索的洞穴者，带来不必要的麻烦。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.gigazapper.desc", "A Martian assault soldier who charges an electrified energy spear.", "能够蓄力刺出带电能量矛的火星突击兵。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.glowing_snail.desc", "A snail that has mutated to adapt to the glowing mushroom environment. Fish are significantly attracted to these.", "发光蜗牛是为适应发光蘑菇环境而发生变异的蜗牛品种，鱼儿对它们的吸引力相当大。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.gnome.desc", "A tiny long-bearded sneak who resides in oversized trees. Becomes a lawn ornament when exposed to sunlight.", "侏儒是长着长胡子的小巧地精，居住在高大的树木中。一旦暴露在阳光下，就会变成草坪装饰。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.goblin_archer.desc", "Lending ranged support to the Goblin Army, archers keep a distance and pick off distracted and overwhelmed foes.", "弓箭手会保持距离为哥布林军队提供远程支援，帮助他们分散敌人的注意力，杀敌人一个措手不及。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.goblin_peon.desc", "Common footsoldiers of the Goblin Army, these foul creatures are good for little more than cannon fodder... and breaking down doors.", "这些丑恶的生物是哥布林军队的普通步兵，它们不过就是炮灰……和替死鬼。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.goblin_scout.desc", "The Goblin Army sends lone soldiers out from the beaches to seek out colonies to conquer. They give warning with a tattered sigil.", "哥布林军队会从海滩派出单独的侦察兵，搜寻可征服的聚落，它们会用破旧的徽章发出警示信号。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.goblin_sorcerer.desc", "As primitive as they are, some goblins have the potential for manipulating magicked shadow energy through a form of hexing.", "尽管哥布林相当落后，但有些哥布林却能通过施法操纵魔化的暗影能量。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.goblin_thief.desc", "Quick strike units of the Goblin Army, these pesky foes specialize in nimble movement and close-quarters combat.", "这些恼人的敌人擅长敏捷移动和近身作战，是哥布林军队的快速打击小队。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.goblin_tinkerer.desc", "Exiled from the rest of goblinkind for being an intelligent pacifist, the Tinkerer sells tools for combining accessories into stronger versions.", "这名工匠由于是一个聪明的和平主义者而遭到其他哥布林成员的驱逐，他出售用来将配饰组装成更强版本的工具。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.goblin_warlock.desc", "A goblin spellcaster who calls forth shadowflame spirits and attacks from the air.", "这位哥布林施法者能召来暗影焰幻鬼，并从空中发动魔法攻击。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.goblin_warrior.desc", "The backbone of the Goblin Army infantry, these heavily-armored soldiers can take tremendous damage as they march undeterred.", "这些全副武装的士兵是哥布林军队的步兵骨干，它们可以毫不畏惧地顶着巨大的伤害行进。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.golden_mimic.desc", "Talking to a chest doesn't cause craziness, but if the chest answers back, it may cause death! It still contains rare treasure, regardless!", "对着宝箱说话不会让人发疯，但如果宝箱回应了你，那可能会让你丧命！不过无论如何，它里面确实藏着稀有宝藏！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.golden_slime.desc", "Legends tell of a slime that has gorged itself on countless coins, a symbol of wealth and fortune.", "传说世界上有一种吃了太多钱币的史莱姆，是财富与运气的象征。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.goldfish.desc", "A seemingly ordinary goldfish, until it decides to rain.", "金鱼看起来平平无奇，可一到下雨天，它就变得不一般了。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.golfer.desc", "The Golfer is a wise, middle-aged man who sells all sorts of golfing equipment. He's got game and knows how to score.", "高尔夫球手是睿智的中年男子，出售各种高尔夫设备。他拿下了许多比赛，知道如何得分。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.granite_elemental.desc", "Earth elementals manifest through many forms by taking on the properties of different materials, such as this hardy granite.", "土元素会吸收不同物质的特性形成多种形态，花岗精便是以坚硬花岗岩为载体的土元素。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.granite_golem.desc", "Strong are the magicked spirits which inhabit the granite masses deep below, this type in particular taking on a humanoid shape.", "栖息在地下深处花岗岩中的魔法幽魂力量强大，花岗岩巨人便是这类幽魂中呈现人形的品种。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.grasshopper.gold.desc", "Rarely, critters are found coated entirely in gold! They are worth great coin to shopkeepers and fish absolutely love golden bait!", "罕见情况下，有些小动物会全身覆金！店主们会出高价收购，而且鱼儿超爱金色的鱼饵！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.grasshopper.green.desc", "It leaps tall blades of grass in a single bound. Fish are fairly attracted to these.", "蚱蜢能一跃跳过高高的草叶，鱼儿很容易被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.gray_grunt.desc", "A heavily built Martian shock trooper trained for close combat.", "体格强壮、擅长近身战斗的火星突击兵。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.green_dumpling_slime.desc", "Slimes that have devoured various medicinal herbs and mugwort appear during a specific festival of the year.", "吞噬了各种草药和艾草的史莱姆，会在一年中特定的节日中出现。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.green_jellyfish.desc", "That strange tingling sensation in the water may be the unwelcome surging of electrical death from a brainless jellyfish. Swim with care.", "水中若出现奇怪的刺痛感，可能是无脑的绿水母释放的致命电流所致，游泳时务必小心。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.green_slime.desc", "A simple, gelatinous creature that swallows anything and everything whole! It takes a long time to digest anything.", "绿史莱姆是简单的胶状生物，见到任何东西都会整个吞下！但消化过程需要很长时间。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.grubby.desc", "Slimy, yet satisfying! Fish are somewhat attracted to these.", "蛆虫黏糊糊的，却很受鱼儿青睐！鱼儿多少会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.guide.desc", "The Guide always offers useful advice and crafting recipes. His origins and unusual connections to this world remain a mystery.", "向导总是提供有用的建议和制作配方。他的出身以及他与这个世界非同寻常的联系仍然是一个谜。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hallowed_mimic.desc", "Mimics struck with the blessing surge with energy and become powerful. They can be birthed from ordinary chests by force.", "受神圣福佑加持的宝箱怪会进化为神圣宝箱怪，能量大幅涌动、实力显著提升。通过外力作用，也能从普通宝箱中强制催生它们。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.harpy.desc", "Winged, demi-human women defend their territory against invaders by impaling them with their razor-sharp feathers.", "鸟妖是长有翅膀的亚人女性，会用锋利如刀的羽毛刺穿入侵者，以此守护自己的领地。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hat_spore_zombie.desc", "The fungus controlling the minds of these zombies wants only one thing: brains! This is very convenient for the zombie.", "控制孢子僵尸（帽子蘑菇）心智的真菌只有一个目标：吞噬大脑！这与僵尸本身的本能不谋而合，对僵尸而言极为“方便”。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hell_butterfly.desc", "A solemn butterfly seeking blooms rooted in hell. Its wings glimmer with fiery veins.", "地狱蝴蝶是在地狱中寻觅绽放花朵的冷峻生灵，翅膀上的火红翅脉闪烁着微光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hellbat.desc", "What's worse than a rabid, fast-flying, and annoying flying rodent? One that is on fire, of course!", "狂躁易怒、飞行迅捷又惹人厌烦的飞行动物已够麻烦，而浑身燃烧着地狱之火的地狱蝙蝠，无疑是雪上加霜！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.herpling.desc", "These hyper, demented, slug-like fiends serve the crimson horde with an unstoppable appetite for blood and flesh.", "蹦蹦兽是形似鼻涕虫的疯狂恶魔，行动亢奋且残暴，对血肉有着无法抑制的渴望，始终为猩红部落效力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hill_of_flesh.desc", "The duality of the world has forged the Wall of Flesh into another adaptive form for the world. As the core and guardian of the world, this towering demon lord exists to seal away the powerful ancient souls.", "世界的双相，造就了血肉墙对世界另一适应形态的出现。血肉山是世界的核心与守护者，这尊高大的恶魔领主存在的意义，便是将强大的远古灵魂封印起来。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hoplite.desc", "In the ruins of an ancient civilization now deeply buried, some of its spear-hurling soldiers still walk its marble-adorned paths.", "在已深埋地下的古老文明废墟中，一些投掷长矛的士兵仍在大理石铺就的路径上巡逻。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hornet.desc", "Aggressive flying insects which swarm the jungle depths. Their venomous barbs discharge over great distances at high velocity.", "黄蜂是活跃在丛林深处的攻击性飞虫，能从极远的距离高速射出有毒的螫针。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hornet_fatty.desc", "Aggressive flying insects which swarm the jungle depths. Their venomous barbs discharge over great distances at high velocity.", "肥胖的黄蜂是活跃在丛林深处的攻击性飞虫，能从极远的距离高速射出有毒的螫针。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hornet_honey.desc", "Aggressive flying insects which swarm the jungle depths. Their venomous barbs discharge over great distances at high velocity.", "沾蜜的黄蜂是活跃在丛林深处的攻击性飞虫，能从极远的距离高速射出有毒的螫针。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hornet_leafy.desc", "Aggressive flying insects which swarm the jungle depths. Their venomous barbs discharge over great distances at high velocity.", "带叶的黄蜂是活跃在丛林深处的攻击性飞虫，能从极远的距离高速射出有毒的螫针。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hornet_spikey.desc", "Aggressive flying insects which swarm the jungle depths. Their venomous barbs discharge over great distances at high velocity.", "带尖刺的黄蜂是活跃在丛林深处的攻击性飞虫，能从极远的距离高速射出有毒的螫针。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.hornet_stingy.desc", "Aggressive flying insects which swarm the jungle depths. Their venomous barbs discharge over great distances at high velocity.", "带毒刺的黄蜂是活跃在丛林深处的攻击性飞虫，能从极远的距离高速射出有毒的螫针。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ice_bat.desc", "As if bats weren't enough of a nuisance already, Ice Bats can freeze flesh solid with a touch, leaving their prey defenseless.", "蝙蝠本就足够麻烦，而冰雪蝙蝠只需一碰就能将生物的肉体冻成硬块，让猎物彻底失去防御能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ice_elemental.desc", "Water elementals become icy when dense strong magicks accumulate in the coldest places. Their frosty shards freeze all.", "在极寒之地聚集的浓厚强力魔法，会使水元素转化为冰雪精。它们周身的冰霜碎片能冻结万物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ice_golem.desc", "Sub-zero temperatures, blinding snow flurries, and being blasted apart by an icy construct are some of the dangers of blizzards.", "暴风雪的危险不止零下低温与刺眼飞雪，还包括被这种冰雪构造体炸得粉身碎骨。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ice_mimic.desc", "Talking to a chest doesn't cause craziness, but if the chest answers back, it may cause death! It still contains rare treasure, regardless!", "对着宝箱说话不会让人发疯，但要是宝箱回了话，那很可能会让人丧命！不过无论如何，它里面确实藏着稀有宝藏！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ice_slime.desc", "Slimes that spent too long in arctic temperatures may begin to partially freeze, developing a shifting layer of ice on their surface.", "在极寒环境中停留过久的史莱姆会部分冻结，体表形成一层不断移动的冰层。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ice_tortoise.desc", "Like their jungle cousins, ice tortoises are an unexpectedly serious threat, possessing surprising speed and mobility.", "冰雪陆龟和它们的丛林近亲一样，是远超预期的可怕威胁，拥有惊人的速度与机动性。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.icy_merman.desc", "Mermen rarely stray far from the ocean. Those that do can become lost, wander into cold caverns, and become icy undead fish men.", "人鱼极少远离海洋，一旦迷途闯入寒冷洞穴，便会化为冰冷的不死鱼人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.illuminant_bat.desc", "Blessed with the prismatic light of the Hallow, the Illuminant Bats are a vibrant pink blur arcing across the darkness of the Underground.", "夜明蝙蝠受神圣之地的棱镜光芒祝福，身体呈现亮粉色，飞行时会在黑暗的地下空间划出一道模糊的光影弧线。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_bunny.amber.desc", "These colorful rabbits made their way so deep, their reaction to magicked gems resulted in a coveted sparkling appearance.", "琥珀兔兔躲得极深，接触到魔法宝石后，身体呈现出令人喜爱的闪亮模样。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_bunny.amethyst.desc", "These colorful rabbits made their way so deep, their reaction to magicked gems resulted in a coveted sparkling appearance.", "紫晶兔兔躲得极深，接触到魔法宝石后，身体呈现出令人喜爱的闪亮模样。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_bunny.diamond.desc", "These colorful rabbits made their way so deep, their reaction to magicked gems resulted in a coveted sparkling appearance.", "钻石兔兔躲得极深，接触到魔法宝石后，身体呈现出令人喜爱的闪亮模样。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_bunny.emerald.desc", "These colorful rabbits made their way so deep, their reaction to magicked gems resulted in a coveted sparkling appearance.", "翡翠兔兔躲得极深，接触到魔法宝石后，身体呈现出令人喜爱的闪亮模样。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_bunny.gold.desc", "Rarely, critters are found coated entirely in gold! Shopkeepers will pay handsomely for these, or you can show them off in cages!", "罕见情况下，有些小动物会全身覆金！店主们愿意出高价收购，你也可以把它们关在笼子里炫耀！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_bunny.ruby.desc", "These colorful rabbits made their way so deep, their reaction to magicked gems resulted in a coveted sparkling appearance.", "红玉兔兔躲得极深，接触到魔法宝石后，身体呈现出令人喜爱的闪亮模样。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_bunny.sapphire.desc", "These colorful rabbits made their way so deep, their reaction to magicked gems resulted in a coveted sparkling appearance.", "蓝玉兔兔躲得极深，接触到魔法宝石后，身体呈现出令人喜爱的闪亮模样。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_bunny.topaz.desc", "These colorful rabbits made their way so deep, their reaction to magicked gems resulted in a coveted sparkling appearance.", "黄玉兔兔躲得极深，接触到魔法宝石后，身体呈现出令人喜爱的闪亮模样。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_squirrel.amber.desc", "Glistening squirrels who strayed too deep become ensorcelled with residual cursed energy retained in gemstones.", "琥珀松鼠因迷途过深，被宝石中残留的诅咒能量所迷惑，身体变得闪闪发光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_squirrel.amethyst.desc", "Glistening squirrels who strayed too deep become ensorcelled with residual cursed energy retained in gemstones.", "紫晶松鼠因迷途过深，被宝石中残留的诅咒能量所迷惑，身体变得闪闪发光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_squirrel.diamond.desc", "Glistening squirrels who strayed too deep become ensorcelled with residual cursed energy retained in gemstones.", "钻石松鼠因迷途过深，被宝石中残留的诅咒能量所迷惑，身体变得闪闪发光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_squirrel.emerald.desc", "Glistening squirrels who strayed too deep become ensorcelled with residual cursed energy retained in gemstones.", "翡翠松鼠因迷途过深，被宝石中残留的诅咒能量所迷惑，身体变得闪闪发光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_squirrel.gold.desc", "Rarely, critters are found coated entirely in gold! Shopkeepers will pay handsomely for these, or you can show them off in cages!", "罕见情况下，有些小动物会全身覆金！店主们愿意出高价收购，你也可以把它们关在笼子里炫耀！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_squirrel.ruby.desc", "Glistening squirrels who strayed too deep become ensorcelled with residual cursed energy retained in gemstones.", "红玉松鼠因迷途过深，被宝石中残留的诅咒能量所迷惑，身体变得闪闪发光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_squirrel.sapphire.desc", "Glistening squirrels who strayed too deep become ensorcelled with residual cursed energy retained in gemstones.", "蓝玉松鼠因迷途过深，被宝石中残留的诅咒能量所迷惑，身体变得闪闪发光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jewel_squirrel.topaz.desc", "Glistening squirrels who strayed too deep become ensorcelled with residual cursed energy retained in gemstones.", "黄玉松鼠因迷途过深，被宝石中残留的诅咒能量所迷惑，身体变得闪闪发光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jungle_bat.desc", "These small, annoying creatures aren't to be underestimated. A deadly end awaits for those swarmed by these fangy rodents.", "这些烦人的小型丛林蝙蝠绝不可轻视，一旦被这群尖牙啮齿动物包围，便只有死路一条。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jungle_creeper.desc", "The itsy bitsy spider climbed up a jungle vine, down came a hapless explorer and the spider got to dine. The End.", "“小小蜘蛛爬藤蔓，倒霉探险掉下来，蜘蛛饱餐真痛快。故事完。”");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jungle_mimic.desc", "These ancient mimics lurk in the jungles of a distant world, though the 'treasures' they guard are far from ordinary. One can't help but question the intentions of those who buried them.", "这些古老的宝箱怪处于某个世界的丛林中，可惜埋藏的“宝物”实在过于特殊。不得不怀疑埋藏者的用意");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.jungle_slime.desc", "A simple, gelatinous creature that swallows anything and everything whole! It takes a long time to digest anything.", "丛林史莱姆是简单的胶状生物，见到任何东西都会整个吞下！但消化过程需要很长时间。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.king_slime.desc", "Slimes normally aren't intelligent, but occasionally they merge together to become a powerful force to swallow all things.", "史莱姆王通常史莱姆并不具备智慧，但偶尔它们会融合成一股强大的力量，足以吞噬世间万物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ladybug.gold.desc", "Rarely, critters are found coated entirely in gold! They are worth great coin to shopkeepers and fish absolutely love golden bait!", "罕见情况下，有些小动物会全身覆金！店主们会出高价收购，而且鱼儿超爱金色的鱼饵！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ladybug.red.desc", "A brilliant red insect often associated with luck. Fishing with these as bait may result in unwanted karma.", "瓢虫是亮红色的昆虫，常被视为好运的象征。但用它们当鱼饵钓鱼，可能会招来不好的运气。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.lava_bat.desc", "What's worse than a rabid, fast-flying, and annoying flying rodent? One that is on fire, of course!", "有什么比狂躁、恼人、疾飞的飞行啮齿动物更糟糕呢？显然，答案之一是：浑身冒火的熔岩蝙蝠！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.lava_slime.desc", "Due to the heat of the underworld, these slimes have taken on the properties of lava. Slaying them is difficult and dangerous.", "受地狱高温影响，熔岩史莱姆已具备熔岩的特性——不仅体表灼热，且韧性极强，想要击杀它们既困难又危险。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.leech.desc", "A worm-like parasite spit forth from the Wall of Flesh, filled with the lifeblood of its host. This blood has healing properties.", "血蛭是从血肉墙体内喷出的蠕虫状寄生虫，充满了宿主的生命之血，这些血液具备治愈能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.light_lamia.desc", "By the time glowing red eyes appear in the darkness of the desert caves, it is already too late. The lamias have found their prey.", "当地下沙漠洞穴的黑暗中出现发光的红色眼眸时，一切都已太晚——地下沙漠的拉弥亚早已锁定了自己的猎物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.light_mummy.desc", "With the sands transmogrified by outside forces, those put to rest in the desert, whether good or evil, now rise to maim and kill.", "光明木乃伊原本是安息在沙漠中的逝者，受外界力量改变沙漠形态的影响，无论生前善恶，如今都化为亡灵苏醒，肆意残杀。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.lightning_bug.desc", "Appears at night in blessed locations, filling the sky with flashing cyan light. Fish are especially attracted to these.", "荧光虫夜晚出现在福佑之地，闪烁的蓝绿光芒点亮夜空。鱼儿特别容易被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.luminous_slime.desc", "Slimes exposed to the light of the Hallow's crystals begin to emit that very same light, glowing brightly in the darkness.", "夜明史莱姆因暴露在神圣之地的水晶光芒中，自身也开始散发同样的光芒，在黑暗环境中显得格外耀眼。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.maggot.desc", "An unsavory larval bug which feasts on dead, rotting matter. Fish are somewhat attracted to these.", "蝇蛆是令人不适的幼虫，以腐烂的尸体为食。鱼儿多少会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.magma_snail.desc", "A unique species of snail which withstands extreme heat. Its boiling slime trail melts down most weaker surfaces.", "岩浆蜗牛是能承受极端高温的独特蜗牛品种，其沸腾的黏液轨迹能融化大多数较脆弱的表面。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.man_eater.desc", "A sharp-toothed plant with a taste for human flesh. It has the ability to hide inside the mud and reach over great distances.", "食人怪是长有锋利牙齿的肉食植物，偏好人类血肉。它能潜藏在泥土中，攻击范围远超想象。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.martian_officer.desc", "A tactical officer protected by a regenerating personal shield.", "受到可再生个人护盾保护的火星战术军官。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.martian_probe.desc", "Sensing growing power on the planet, otherworldly beings send space-age technology to scan for advanced lifeforms.", "异界生物察觉到这颗星球上的力量正不断增强，便派出具备太空时代技术的火星探测器，用于扫描寻找先进生命形态。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.martian_walker.desc", "A fast biomechanical walker that stops briefly to fire laser bursts.", "高速生物机械步行机，会短暂停下并连续发射激光。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.mechanic.desc", "The Mechanic was imprisoned for her aptitude in engineering. She sells wiring and tools for putting together anything imaginable.", "机械师因在工程方面的才能而被监禁。她出售电线和工具，用来组装任何可以想象的东西。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.merchant.desc", "The Merchant acts as a simple general store of sorts, providing useful starter tools and supplies needed for exploration.", "商人就像一个简单的杂货店，提供有用的新手工具和探索所需的物资。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.meteor_head.desc", "When meteorites strike the surface, their fragments lay scattered for the taking. Some pieces are alive, and will attack.", "陨石撞击地表后，碎片会散落各处等待拾取。但有些碎片是“活的”，会主动发起攻击。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.moss_hornet.desc", "The empowered flora of the Jungle has merged with these species of Hornet, strengthening their exoskeletons and stingers.", "丛林中能量充沛的植物已与这类苔藓黄蜂融合，强化了它们的外骨骼与毒刺。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.mother_slime.desc", "Critical to the lifecycle of the slime species, these oversized jiggling masses are often found carrying their young deep underground.", "史莱姆之母对史莱姆物种的生命周期至关重要，这些体型庞大、摇摇晃晃的胶状生物，常带着幼崽栖息在地下深处。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.mummy.desc", "With the sands transmogrified by outside forces, those put to rest in the desert, whether good or evil, now rise to maim and kill.", "外界力量改变了沙漠的形态，那些安息于此的生灵——无论善恶——如今都苏醒过来，肆意残杀。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.mystic_frog.desc", "A curious frog with a funny hat, surrounded by potent magic! Perhaps something can break its curse... you probably shouldn't kiss it!", "神秘青蛙戴着滑稽的帽子，周身环绕着强大的魔法！或许有东西能解除它的诅咒……但你大概不该亲吻它！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.mystic_slime.desc", "This slime knows that great witches wear impressive hats, but it only found a droopy one. Might explain the backfired polymorph!", "神秘史莱姆知道，强大的女巫都戴着气派的帽子，可它只找到一顶耷拉的软帽。难怪它的变形术总是弄巧成拙！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.nerdy_slime.desc", "Just a smidge cleverer than other slimes, this slime discovered how to coexist with humans. The secret: accessorizing!", "书呆子史莱姆只比其他史莱姆聪明一点点，却摸索出了与人类共存的方法。秘诀就是：搭配饰品！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.nurse.desc", "The Nurse's snarky attitude and poor bedside manner may be scary, but for a price, she will cure all that ails a wounded Terrarian.", "护士的刻薄态度和糟糕的护理方式可能会让人害怕，但只要付出一定的代价，她就能完全治愈受创的泰拉瑞亚人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.nymph.desc", "Masterfully deceives explorers by posing as a lost girl, then attacks with ferocious might, blood-lust in her eyes.", "宁芙擅长伪装成迷路的女孩欺骗探险者，随后便会眼中带着嗜血的欲望，发起凶猛攻击。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.old_man.desc", "This hapless Old Man carries the burden of a heavy curse. It's said at night he transforms into a horrific demon which guards the Dungeon.", "这个不幸的老人背负着沉重的诅咒。据说一到夜晚，他就会变成守护地牢的恐怖恶魔。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.painter.desc", "The Painter can talk about all the different shades of colors with which one can paint the walls. He'll sell but a handful of them!", "关于刷墙的油漆，这名油漆工可以就各种颜色大谈特谈一番。但他只售卖其中一小部分油漆！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.party_girl.desc", "Positive beyond comprehension, the Party Girl will use any excuse to celebrate. She sells party favors and flashy things.", "派对女孩的乐观简直超乎想象，她总能找到借口举办庆祝活动。她售卖派对用品和各种亮眼的小物件。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.penguin.desc", "Penguins make their home in the coldest regions of the world, waddling around looking for tasty fish.", "企鹅在世界上最寒冷的地区安家，摇摇摆摆地四处寻找美味的鱼儿。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pink_jellyfish.desc", "That strange tingling sensation in the water may be the unwelcome surging of electrical death from a brainless jellyfish. Swim with care.", "水中若出现奇怪的刺痛感，很可能是无脑的粉水母释放的致命电击。游泳时务必小心。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pink_slime.desc", "The smallest slime ever recorded, their extreme cellular density makes them incredibly durable for their small size. They eat money.", "粉史莱姆是有记录以来最小的史莱姆，其极高的细胞密度让小巧的体型拥有了惊人的耐用性。它们以钱币为食。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.piranha.desc", "Just one of these sharp-toothed fish can easily end a life. Luckily, they tend to swarm their victims in large groups! Life is grand.", "仅凭一条食人鱼，就足以轻易夺走一条生命。不幸的是，它们还喜欢成群围攻猎物！真是“精彩”的生命法则。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pirate_captain.desc", "A pirate captain's love for riches is only rivaled by his obsession with heavy gunpowder and large, rampart-shattering cannons!", "海盗船长对财富的贪婪，只有他对烈性火药和能摧毁壁垒的巨型大炮的痴迷能与之匹敌！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pirate_corsair.desc", "Once mercenaries from a distant land, Corsairs brandish deadly scimitars with unyielding skill and a cut-throat agenda.", "私船海盗原本是来自遥远国度的雇佣兵，如今挥舞着致命的弯刀，凭借精湛的刀法和冷酷的行事风格肆虐海洋。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pirate_crossbower.desc", "Some wee lasses aren't content staying at port waiting for their men to return from a raid, so they join in on the deadly fun!", "有些海盗弩手是不愿在港口等待同伴劫掠归来的女子，于是主动加入海盗队伍，参与这场致命的掠夺游戏。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pirate_deadeye.desc", "Nobody knows if 'Dead Eye' refers to their precise aim, or the fact that one of their eyes is indeed 'dead'... like their targets.", "海盗神射手的“死眼”称号来源成谜：有人说是指它们精准的瞄准能力，也有人说是因为它们的一只眼睛早已“死去”，如同它们的猎物一般。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pirate_deckhand.desc", "They are either washing the deck of their ship of seaweed and ale, or wiping the dirt with the faces of unsuspecting Terrarians.", "海盗水手要么在船上清洗甲板上的海草与麦芽酒污渍，要么就用毫无防备的泰拉瑞亚人的脸来“擦拭”地面。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pirate_parrot.desc", "A pirate's best friend, the parrot, will tear the eyes out of any greasy landlubber with its sharp, pointy talons.", "鹦鹉是海盗的得力伙伴，会用锋利的爪子抓挠并啄瞎那些“油腻旱鸭子”（指不擅航海的人）的眼睛。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pirates_curse.desc", "Even death cannot put an end to this captain's pursuit.", "即使死亡也无法终止这位船长的追击。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.pixie.desc", "A larger, more luminous form of fairy. Pixies provide the Hallow with more blessed light and aid in the cleansing of the land.", "妖精是体型更大、光芒更盛的仙灵变种，能为神圣之地带来更多福佑之光，助力净化被腐化或猩红污染的土地。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.plantera.desc", "A dormant, yet powerful floral guardian awoken by the fallout of Cthulhu's destroyed machinations. Its reach spans the entire jungle.", "世纪之花是沉睡的强大植物守卫，因克苏鲁被摧毁的阴谋余波而苏醒，其影响力遍及整个丛林。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.possess_armor.desc", "Whatever possessed this suit of armor to suddenly walk about and start killing everyone? It lacks a corporeal body.", "究竟是什么东西附身于这套盔甲，让它突然能动弹并开始滥杀无辜？它连实体都没有啊。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.prismatic_lacewing.desc", "Should one of these luminescent beings perish in the chaos of night, a sleeping tyrant is rumored to violently awaken.", "传说若一只七彩草蛉这样的发光生物在夜晚的混乱中死亡，某个沉睡的暴君便会被猛烈唤醒。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.purple_slime.desc", "A simple, gelatinous creature that swallows anything and everything whole! It takes a long time to digest anything.", "紫史莱姆是简单的胶状生物，见到任何东西都会整个吞下！但消化过程需要很长时间。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.queen_bee.desc", "This highly aggressive monstrosity responds violently when her larva is disturbed; the honey-laden hives are her home turf.", "蜂王是极具攻击性的恐怖生物，一旦幼虫受到惊扰便会暴力反击——布满蜂蜜的蜂巢便是她的主场。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.ray_gunner.desc", "An elite Martian marksman that commonly rides a Scutlix and continues fighting on foot if its mount falls.", "常骑乘鳞甲怪作战的火星精英射手；坐骑倒下后仍会徒步继续战斗。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.red_devil.desc", "Conjuring potent spears of dark magic, these elite demons are a serious threat to any who dare enter their abode.", "红魔鬼作为精英恶魔，能召唤出蕴含强大黑魔法的长矛，对任何胆敢闯入其领地的生物而言，都是极具威胁的存在。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.red_slime.desc", "A simple, gelatinous creature that swallows anything and everything whole! It takes a long time to digest anything.", "红史莱姆是简单的胶状生物，见到任何东西都会整个吞下！但消化过程需要很长时间。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.retinazer.desc", "Belonging to a pair of mechanically recreated Eyes of Cthulhu, this one focuses its energy into firing powerful lasers.", "激光眼是一对机械重构的克苏鲁之眼中的一只，它专注于将能量凝聚成强大的激光进行发射。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.rock_golem.desc", "Dense-minded living stone formation. Awaits weary cavern dwellers to pound them into juicy rubble.", "岩石巨人是心智迟钝的活石构造体，它会等待疲惫的洞穴生物经过，然后将其砸成碎末。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.rune_wizard.desc", "Tim's more powerful and much better-looking older brother. He, too, prefers the heat, but not excessively.", "符文巫师是蒂姆的哥哥，不仅实力更强，外形也更英俊。他同样喜欢温暖环境，但不喜欢极端高温。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.sand_poacher.desc", "These unnaturally large scorpions have adapted to swiftly pursuing their prey along the walls with their sharp, venomous tails.", "这些异常巨大的蝎子已进化出沿墙壁快速追击猎物的能力，其锋利的毒尾是致命武器。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.sand_shark.desc", "In ancient times, a saltwater river once ran through the desert. These powerful creatures evolved to survive in the now dry sand.", "远古时期曾有一条咸水河贯穿沙漠，如今这些沙鲨已进化出在干燥沙层中生存的能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.scorpion.black.desc", "Despite its menacing appearance, it is quite docile unless threatened or facing smaller prey. Fish are occasionally attracted to these.", "黑蝎子虽然外表吓人，但除非受到威胁或面对小型猎物，否则性情相当温顺。鱼儿偶尔会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.scorpion.normal.desc", "Harmlessly scuttles around the desert looking for food. Fish are barely attracted to these.", "蝎子在沙漠中无害地四处觅食。鱼儿几乎不会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.scutlix.desc", "A powerful alien cavalry mount that charges down targets while carrying a Ray Gunner.", "强大的异星骑兵坐骑，驮着激光枪手向目标发起冲锋。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.servant_of_cthulhu.desc", "Young Demon Eyes newly birthed from the Eye of Cthulhu, brought forth to protect their master by any means necessary.", "克苏鲁之仆是从克苏鲁之眼新生的小恶魔眼，会不惜一切代价保护自己的主人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.shadow_mimic.desc", "Talking to a chest doesn't cause craziness, but if the chest answers back, it may cause death! It still contains rare treasure, regardless!", "对着宝箱说话不会让人发疯，但如果宝箱回应了你，那可能会让你丧命！不过无论如何，它里面确实藏着稀有宝藏！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.shadowflame_apparition.desc", "The shadowflame magicks are powerful spiritual remnants of twisted goblin ancestors, wrought from powerful summoning.", "暗影焰幻鬼是扭曲哥布林祖先的强大精神残魂，通过强力召唤仪式被唤醒，能操控暗影焰魔法。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.shark.desc", "Once these ocean predators catch a whiff of blood, they become relentless and unstoppable in their ravenous pursuit.", "这些海洋掠食者一旦嗅到血腥味，便会陷入疯狂的追逐，既不知疲倦也无法阻挡。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.short_bones.desc", "Cursed with undeath, the former inhabitants of the Dungeon roam endlessly through its halls, seeking a victim for their unending fury.", "矮骷髅是受不死诅咒的原地牢居民，在地牢大厅中永无休止地游荡，寻找宣泄无尽怒火的目标。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.skeleton_merchant.desc", "Most skeletons are out for blood, but not the Skeleton Merchant. He just wants to sell supplies, such as rare torches and yo-yo gear.", "大多数骷髅都嗜杀成性，但骷髅商人不一样。他只想售卖物资，比如稀有火把和悠悠球装备。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.skeletron.desc", "The disembodied bones of a former tyrant pulsed with a hatred so strong, it left behind a mighty curse which guards the Dungeon.", "骷髅王是前暴君的离体骸骨，因强烈的仇恨而搏动，留下了强大的诅咒守护着地牢。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.skeletron_prime.desc", "Mechanically reconstructed for reviving Cthulhu, this Skeletron has more arms than ever before, and a variety of fierce weapons.", "机械骷髅王是为复活克苏鲁而进行机械重构的产物，它拥有比以往更多的手臂和各种强悍武器。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.sluggy.desc", "Slow and covered in a slick mucus. Fish are especially attracted to these.", "鼻涕虫行动缓慢，全身覆盖着光滑黏液。鱼儿特别容易被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.snail.desc", "A slimy mollusk that thrives in damp, dark places. Fish are barely attracted to these.", "蜗牛是黏糊糊的软体动物，生活在潮湿、黑暗的地方。鱼儿几乎不会被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.snatcher.desc", "A sharp-toothed plant with a taste for human flesh. It has the ability to hide inside the mud and reach over great distances.", "抓人草是长有锋利牙齿的肉食植物，偏好人类血肉。它能潜藏在泥土中，攻击范围远超想象。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.snow_flinx.desc", "A strange, round furry mammal with an unusually large, protruding nose. They are extremely lightweight.", "小雪怪是外形圆滚的毛茸茸哺乳动物，长着格外突出的大鼻子，体重轻得惊人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.spazmatism.desc", "Belonging to a pair of mechanically recreated Eyes of Cthulhu, this one chases at high speed, exhaling cursed flames.", "魔焰眼是一对机械重构的克苏鲁之眼中的一只，它会高速追击敌人，并喷射诅咒火焰。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.spiked_ice_slime.desc", "This Ice Slime has large ice shards in its mass from excessive exposure to the cold. Somehow, it is able to launch these at its prey.", "这种冰雪史莱姆因长期暴露在严寒中，体内凝结出大量冰碎片，且能以某种方式将这些碎片射向猎物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.spiked_jungle_slime.desc", "Frequent consumption of the Jungle's toxins and thorns has resulted in a slime covered in venomous spikes.", "尖刺丛林史莱姆因长期吞食丛林中的毒素与荆棘，体表布满了带毒的尖刺。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.spiked_slime.desc", "The King Slime splits off more aggressive individuals to protect itself. They hurl out their distinctive hardened spikes.", "史莱姆王分裂出更具有攻击性的个体以保护自己。它们会发射出独特的硬化尖刺。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.spore_bat.desc", "The tables have turned on a variety of rabid bats, themselves enwrought with a deadly fungal infection.", "曾经狂暴的蝙蝠如今角色反转，它们自身被致命的真菌感染，沦为疾病的载体。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.spore_skeleton.desc", "Skeletons meandering through more moist caverns become hosts for glowing fungal growth, greatly empowering them.", "在潮湿洞穴中游荡的骷髅成为发光真菌的宿主，这些真菌大幅增强了它们的战力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.spore_zombie.desc", "The fungus controlling the minds of these zombies wants only one thing: brains! This is very convenient for the zombie.", "控制孢子僵尸（蘑菇）心智的真菌只有一个目标：吞噬大脑！这与僵尸本身的本能不谋而合，对僵尸而言极为“方便”。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.squire_slime.desc", "A hero amongst slimes, it wields the greatest arms and armor known to its kind. It doesn't actually know how to use them, but it's a start.", "侍卫史莱姆是史莱姆中的英雄，手持同类中最厉害的武器与盔甲。虽然它还不知道怎么用，但也算迈出了第一步。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.squirrel.gold.desc", "Rarely, critters are found coated entirely in gold! Shopkeepers will pay handsomely for these, or you can show them off in cages!", "罕见情况下，有些小动物会全身覆金！店主们愿意出高价收购，你也可以把它们关在笼子里炫耀！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.squirrel.normal.desc", "Fast moving and erratic woodland creatures with grayish-brown fur. Got nuts?", "松鼠是动作敏捷、行踪不定的林地动物，皮毛呈灰褐色。你有坚果吗？（它可等着呢）");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.squirrel.red.desc", "Rare, red-furred hyperactive rodents which scurry about the woods.", "红松鼠是罕见的红毛啮齿动物，性子活泼好动，总在树林里窜来窜去。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.steampunker.desc", "The Steampunker has a particular taste for steam-fueled machinery and gadgets. She sells her gizmos with an endearing accent.", "蒸汽朋克人对蒸汽驱动的机械与装置情有独钟。她带着可爱的口音，售卖自己发明的各类小玩意儿。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.stinkbug.desc", "These sneaky pests have a knack for invading even the most airtight of homes, projecting their cilantro-like stench everywhere if disturbed.", "臭虫是鬼祟的害虫，就算是密不透风的房子，它们也能钻进去；一旦受到干扰，就会散发出类似香菜的臭味，弥漫各处。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.surly_slime.desc", "Irascible and insufferable, this grumpy slime is probably up to no good. Probably. It's the thought that counts, really.", "暴躁史莱姆脾气坏、惹人厌，说不定没什么好心眼。或许吧。不过重要的是这份“可能”的心意（才怪）。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.swamp_slime.desc", "So many people have been trapped in the swamp that the native slimes here look particularly horrifying.", "由于陷入沼泽的人不在少数，导致了这里的原生史莱姆看上去特别骇人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.sweet_slime.desc", "Some wasps discovered that slimes accidentally fallen into honey taste far more delicious, so swarms raise these slimes on occasion.", "有的黄蜂发现，不小心掉入蜂蜜中的史莱姆会变得更加可口。于是蜂群有时候会养殖这种史莱姆。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.tainted_ghoul.desc", "Ghouls infested by the Crimson leak vile ichor from their mouths, weakening the defenses of their foes with every bite.", "红染食尸鬼被猩红之力感染，嘴巴会不断渗出邪恶灵液，每一次啃咬都会削弱敌人的防御能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.the_bride.desc", "It's uncertain if the bride was wed before or after her death, but the story ends tragically for anyone who crosses her path.", "没人知道僵尸新娘是生前还是死后结的婚，但所有与她相遇的人，结局都很悲惨。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.the_groom.desc", "Tall, handsome, and dead. This unlucky fellow did not survive his wedding and is ready to take it out on everyone.", "僵尸新郎高大英俊，却早已死亡。这位不幸的家伙没能熬过自己的婚礼，如今准备向所有人发泄怒火。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.the_hungry_attached.desc", "The Wall of Flesh's many mouths, attached by bloody veins. As a last resort, they can tear away and hungrily chase down threats.", "饿鬼（连接）是血肉墙的众多嘴巴，通过血色血管连接在主体上。万不得已时，它们会挣脱束缚，贪婪地追杀威胁。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.the_hungry_flying.desc", "The Wall of Flesh's many mouths, attached by bloody veins. As a last resort, they can tear away and hungrily chase down threats.", "饿鬼（飞行）是血肉墙的众多嘴巴，通过血色血管连接在主体上。万不得已时，它们会挣脱束缚，贪婪地追杀威胁。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.tim.desc", "An enchanter in life, this funny fellow won't give up his robe or wizard hat without a fight. He prefers warmer caverns.", "蒂姆生前是一名魔法师，这个有趣的家伙绝不会轻易放弃自己的长袍和巫师帽——除非打赢他。他偏爱温暖的洞穴环境。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.tomb_crawler.desc", "The desert is home to one of the largest varieties of worms across the land. It has a voracious appetite for careless explorers.", "沙漠是这片土地上最大型蠕虫的栖息地之一，这种墓穴爬虫对粗心的探险者有着极大的胃口。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.traveling_merchant.desc", "The flamboyantly-dressed Traveling Merchant travels far and wide to bring unique, cultural wares from time to time.", "衣着华丽的旅行商人走遍四方，时常带来独具特色的各地商品。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.tropic_slime.desc", "By the beaches in daylight, tropical slimes emerge to sunbathe the tropical fish inside their bodies.", "在白天的海滩旁，热带史莱姆们会出来晒晒体内的热带鱼。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.truffle.desc", "Harnessing the hidden power of the glowing mushroom, the Truffle forges weapons and tools exclusively in his mushroom home.", "松露人能驾驭发光蘑菇的隐藏力量，只在自己的蘑菇屋里打造武器与工具。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.truffle_worm.desc", "An extremely rare, difficult to catch glowworm. A specific, powerful sea creature is insatiably attracted to these.", "松露虫是极其稀有、难以捕捉的发光蠕虫，有一种特定的强大海洋生物对它情有独钟。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.undead_miner.desc", "There's evidence of spelunkers having explored the caverns in the past... as well as evidence of them having died doing so.", "有证据表明，过去曾有洞穴探险者探索过这些洞穴……也有证据表明，他们在此过程中丧命。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.undead_viking.desc", "Long before there were pirates, stories tell of powerful vikings who raged the seas. Their remains roam the icy caverns below.", "早在海盗出现之前，便有强大维京人纵横海洋的传说。如今他们的遗骸仍在下方冰冷的洞穴中游荡。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.vicious_bunny.desc", "Bunnies are pure beings that normally cannot be afflicted by Crimson, but will succumb under the effects of a Blood Moon.", "兔兔本是纯洁的生物，通常不会被猩红感染，但在血月影响下会屈服。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.vicious_goldfish.desc", "Goldfish become grotesque, blood-sucking fiends of the Crimson when exposed to a Blood Moon.", "金鱼在血月影响下会变成猩红的畸形吸血恶魔。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.vicious_penguin.desc", "During a Blood Moon, the normally docile penguins become infested with the contagious growth of the Crimson.", "血月期间，原本温顺的企鹅会被猩红的传染性增生所侵蚀。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.vile_ghoul.desc", "Ghouls twisted by the Corruption ooze a nasty green bile that ignites on contact with skin, scorching their prey with cursed flames.", "腐恶食尸鬼被腐化之力扭曲，体内会渗出恶心的绿色胆汁，这种胆汁接触皮肤便会燃烧，用诅咒火焰灼烧猎物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.visual_neuron.desc", "Manipulated through the hive mind of the Crimson, Visual Neuron serve as the brain's eyes and orbit around it for defense in numbers.", "视神经元是由猩红之地的群体意识操控的，它们不仅是克苏鲁之脑的眼睛，还成群地围绕在大脑周围提供保护。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.voodoo_demon.desc", "Higher ranking demons can possess a voodoo doll of the chosen one, whose soul is linked with the world's guardian himself.", "身为高阶恶魔的巫毒恶魔，能持有“天选者”的巫毒娃娃——而这具娃娃的灵魂，与世界守卫者本身紧密相连。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.wall_creeper.desc", "They have eight legs, eight eyes, and eight ways to cocoon and feast upon an unsuspecting victim.", "爬墙蜘蛛有八条腿、八只眼，更有八种方法将毫无防备的受害者缠入茧中享用。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.wall_of_flesh.desc", "Serving as the world's core and guardian, the towering demon lord exists to keep powerful ancient spirits sealed away.", "血肉墙是世界的核心与守护者，这尊高大的恶魔领主存在的意义，便是将强大的远古灵魂封印起来。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.wandering_eye.desc", "That suspicious feeling of being watched may very well come true in the dark of night, when Cthulhu's minions roam the skies.", "当克苏鲁的仆从在漆黑的夜晚盘旋空中时，那种被人监视的不安感，很可能是真实存在的。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.wandering_eye_fish.desc", "For mysterious reasons, fish are known to mutate with other living things or even man-made objects. This one is especially violent.", "出于神秘原因，鱼类会与其他生物甚至人造物品发生融合变异，而这只游荡眼球怪鱼格外凶猛。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.water_bolt_mimic.desc", "A seemingly powerful spellbook conceals a monster waiting to bite the fingers of anyone who opens it.", "看似蕴含强大魔力的书本中，藏着一只伺机咬住翻书者手指的怪物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.werewolf.desc", "Cursed by the moonlight, these menacing lupines were once human. Now, they feast on their loved ones instinctively.", "这些凶恶的狼人曾经也是人类，却遭到了月光的诅咒。如今，它们本能地捕食着自己的亲人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.windy_balloon.desc", "Some enterprising slimes ride wind currents with balloons in an effort to find food. Pop their balloons to bring them back down to earth.", "有些胆大的史莱姆会借助气球乘着气流飞行，寻找食物。击破它们的气球就能让其落回地面。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.witch_doctor.desc", "It's unusual for a Lihzahrd to be outside the Temple. Even more unusual are the voodoo things he sells. He prefers his jungle digs.", "丛林蜥蜴待在神庙之外可不寻常。更不寻常的是他出售的巫毒物品。他更喜欢他在丛林的家。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.wither_bone_serpent.desc", "The high concentration of souls in the Soul Sand Valley has turned the remains of these serpentine dragons into deadlier threats.", "灵魂沙峡谷的高浓度灵魂使得这些蛇形巨龙的残骸变得更加致命");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.wizard.desc", "The Wizard is an absent-minded, demented old man who dabbles in the arcane arts. He sells magical trinkets to train new apprentices.", "巫师是个精神恍惚又有些癫狂的健忘老人，醉心于奥术研究。他售卖魔法小饰品，以此培养新的学徒。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.wooden_mimic.desc", "Talking to a chest doesn't cause craziness, but if the chest answers back, it may cause death! It still contains rare treasure, regardless!", "对着宝箱说话不会让人发疯，但如果宝箱回应了你，那可能会让你丧命！不过无论如何，它里面确实藏着稀有宝藏！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.world_feeder.desc", "Ancient magicks have unleashed the dark influences that gave birth to the Eater of Worlds, producing smaller, but just as deadly worms.", "远古魔法释放的黑暗力量催生了世界吞噬怪，同时也孕育出吞世怪这类体型更小、但同样致命的蠕虫生物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.worm.gold.desc", "Rarely, critters are found coated entirely in gold! They are worth great coin to shopkeepers and fish absolutely love golden bait!", "罕见情况下，有些小动物会全身覆金！店主们会出高价收购，而且鱼儿超爱金色的鱼饵！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.worm.nightcrawler.desc", "Worms infused with fallen star magic glow with a glittering light. Fish are extremely attracted to these.", "附魔夜行者是注入了坠落之星魔法的蠕虫，散发着耀眼的光芒，对鱼儿有着极强的吸引力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.worm.normal.desc", "A slick, tubular invertebrate found hiding in rocks, dirt, and grass. Loves the rain. Fish are especially attracted to these.", "蠕虫是光滑的管状无脊椎动物，常藏在岩石、泥土和草丛中，喜欢雨天。鱼儿尤其容易被它们吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.wraith.desc", "Souls belonging to the darkest of hearts were once sealed in the world's core. Now, they roam the night to add to their kind.", "拥有最黑暗心灵的灵魂曾被封印在世界核心，如今它们在夜间游荡，寻找新的成员壮大自己的族群。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.wyvern.desc", "A colossal dragon-like creature unleashed along with the ancient spirits. It rules the skies with its unrivaled might.", "飞龙是与古老灵魂一同被释放的巨型类龙生物，凭借无可匹敌的力量统治着整片天空。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.yellow_slime.desc", "A simple, gelatinous creature that swallows anything and everything whole! It takes a long time to digest anything.", "黄史莱姆是简单的胶状生物，见到任何东西都会整个吞下！但消化过程需要很长时间。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.zombie_merman.desc", "Mermen may be rare and exotic demi-humans, but they can still die... and still come back from that a changed merman.", "人鱼或许是稀有奇特的亚人，但他们仍会死亡……死后还会以不同的形态回归。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.confluence.zoologist.desc", "The Zoologist, resident lycanthrope, adores animals. Her fox-like biology resulted from a cursed animal bite.", "动物学家是定居于此的兽化人，她非常喜欢动物。她那狐狸般的生理状况是由被诅咒的动物咬伤所致。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.allay.desc", "The Allay is a pure and kind soul that loves music.", "悦灵是纯洁善良，爱好音乐的灵魂。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.armadillo.desc", "The Armadillo is a small creature that can curl into a ball to protect itself.", "犰狳是一种能蜷缩成球来保护自己的小型生物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.axolotl.desc", "Axolotls are amphibious creatures living in underground water that can heal players and attack hostile mobs.", "美西螈是生活在地下水中的两栖生物，能治愈玩家并攻击敌对生物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.bat.desc", "Bats are small flying creatures that inhabit caves and are active at night.", "蝙蝠是栖息在洞穴中的小型飞行生物，会在夜间活动。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.bee.desc", "Bees are creatures that pollinate and produce honey, and will sting when provoked.", "蜜蜂是授粉和生产蜂蜜的生物，被激怒时会蜇人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.blaze.desc", "Blazes are hostile mobs in the Nether that shoot fireballs at players.", "烈焰人是下界中的敌对生物，会发射火球攻击玩家。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.bogged.desc", "Bogged are hostile mobs that appear in swamps at night and cause slowness.", "沼骸是夜间出现在沼泽的敌对生物，会造成缓慢效果。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.breeze.desc", "Breezes are flying hostile mobs that shoot wind blasts to push players away.", "旋风人是会飞行的敌对生物，会发射风弹将玩家推开。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.camel.desc", "Camels are desert mounts that can carry two people.", "骆驼是沙漠中的坐骑，能承载俩个人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.cat.desc", "Cats are tamed pets that can scare away Creepers and bring gifts.", "猫是可驯服的宠物，能吓跑苦力怕并带来礼物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.cave_spider.desc", "Cave Spiders are small spider variants living in abandoned mineshafts that inflict a poison effect.", "洞穴蜘蛛是小型蜘蛛变种，生活在废弃矿井，会造成剧毒效果。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.chicken.desc", "Chickens are common farm animals that lay eggs and can be attracted by wheat seeds.", "鸡是常见的农场动物，会下蛋并能被小麦种子吸引。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.cod.desc", "Cod are common fish living in oceans and can serve as a food source.", "鳕鱼是生活在海洋中的常见鱼类，可作为食物来源。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.cow.desc", "Cows are farm animals that provide milk, beef, and leather, and they love to eat grass.", "牛是提供牛奶、牛肉和皮革的农场动物，喜欢吃草。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.creeper.desc", "Creepers are hostile mobs that sneak up and explode, and they are afraid of cats.", "苦力怕是会悄悄靠近并爆炸的敌对生物，害怕猫。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.dolphin.desc", "A playful sea mammal whose intelligence rivals that of humanity.", "一种活泼的海洋哺乳动物，它的智力可与人类媲美。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.donkey.desc", "Donkeys are tamed creatures used for transporting items and can be equipped with chests.", "驴是可以被驯服并用来运输物品的生物，能装备箱子。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.drowned.desc", "Drowned are underwater zombie variants that attack with tridents or fishing rods.", "溺尸是水下的僵尸变种，会使用三叉戟或钓鱼竿攻击。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.elder_guardian.desc", "Elder Guardians are powerful guardians of ocean monuments that apply mining fatigue.", "远古守卫者是海底遗迹的强大守护者，会施加挖掘疲劳效果。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.ender_dragon.desc", "The Ender Dragon guards the End dimension.", "末影龙镇守着末路之地。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.enderman.desc", "Endermen are neutral mobs that can teleport and become hostile when stared at.", "末影人是能传送的中立生物，被直视时会变得敌对。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.endermite.desc", "Endermites are small hostile mobs, usually spawning when using Ender Pearls to teleport.", "末影螨是小型敌对生物，通常在使用末影珍珠传送时生成。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.evoker.desc", "Evokers are hostile illagers that summon Vexes and attack with magic.", "唤魔者是敌对的灾厄村民，会召唤恼鬼并使用魔法攻击。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.fox.desc", "Foxes are cute but cunning creatures that pick up items and can be tamed with berries.", "狐狸是可爱但狡猾的生物，会拾取物品，可被浆果驯服。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.frog.desc", "Prefers bodies of water filled with thick growth. Perfectly content both on land and underwater.", "青蛙偏爱植被茂密的水域，无论是陆地还是水下，它都能轻松适应。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.ghast.desc", "Ghasts are large flying creatures in the Nether that shoot fireballs at players.", "恶魂是下界中的大型飞行生物，会发射火球攻击玩家。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.glow_squid.desc", "Glow Squids are bioluminescent creatures in caves, and their ink sacs can make fluorescent items.", "发光鱿鱼是洞穴中的发光生物，其墨囊可制作荧光物品。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.goat.desc", "Goats live in mountains, are good at jumping, and will ram players and creatures.", "山羊生活在山地，擅长跳跃，会冲撞玩家和生物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.guardian.desc", "Guardians are creatures that protect ocean monuments and attack intruders with lasers.", "守卫者是保护海底遗迹的生物，会用激光攻击入侵者。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.hoglin.desc", "Hoglins are hostile mobs in the Nether that drop pork when killed.", "疣猪兽是下界的敌对生物，被杀死后会掉落猪肉。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.horse.desc", "Horses are tamed mounts with different speeds and jumping abilities depending on their breed.", "马是可驯服的坐骑，不同品种有不同的速度和跳跃能力。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.husk.desc", "Husks are zombie variants in deserts that don't burn in sunlight and cause hunger.", "尸壳是沙漠中的僵尸变种，不会在阳光下燃烧，会造成饥饿效果。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.iron_golem.desc", "Iron Golems are village guardians made of iron blocks and pumpkins that attack hostile mobs.", "铁傀儡是村庄的守护者，由铁块和南瓜制作，会攻击敌对生物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.llama.desc", "Llamas are creatures that can carry items, spit to defend themselves, and form caravans.", "羊驼是能携带物品的生物，会吐口水防御，可组成商队。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.magma_cube.desc", "Magma Cubes are hostile mobs in the Nether made of magma that split into smaller ones.", "岩浆怪是下界中的敌对生物，由岩浆构成，会分裂成小个体。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.mooshroom.desc", "Mooshrooms are special cows on mushroom islands that provide mushroom stew and mycelium.", "哞菇是蘑菇岛上的特殊牛，能提供蘑菇汤和菌丝。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.mule.desc", "Mules are hybrid offspring of horses and donkeys, with strong load-bearing capacity but unable to breed.", "骡子是马和驴的杂交后代，负重能力强但不能繁殖。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.ocelot.desc", "Ocelots live in jungles, can be tamed with raw fish, and can scare away Creepers.", "豹猫生活在丛林中，可被生鱼驯服，能吓跑苦力怕。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.panda.desc", "Pandas live in jungles, have different personalities, and love to eat bamboo.", "熊猫生活在丛林中，有不同的个性，喜欢吃竹子。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.parrot.desc", "Parrots are adorable tropical birds whose vibrant plumage evokes the stunning sunsets above the jungle canopy.", "鹦鹉是可爱的热带鸟类，羽毛色彩让人想起丛林树冠上空的绝美日落。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.phantom.desc", "Phantoms are flying hostile mobs that spawn when players don't sleep for a long time.", "幻翼是在玩家长时间不睡觉时生成的飞行敌对生物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.pig.desc", "Pigs are farm animals attracted by carrots, which can be ridden and controlled with a carrot on a stick.", "猪是农场动物，被胡萝卜吸引，可骑乘并通过胡萝卜钓竿控制。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.piglin.desc", "Piglins are creatures in the Nether that trade with players and are afraid of soul fire.", "猪灵是下界的生物，会与玩家交易，害怕灵魂火。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.piglin_brute.desc", "Piglin Brutes are powerful hostile mobs in the Nether that protect bastion remnants.", "猪灵蛮兵是下界的强大敌对生物，会保护堡垒遗迹。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.pillager.desc", "Pillagers are hostile illagers that participate in raids on villages.", "掠夺者是敌对的灾厄村民，会参与袭击村庄的行动。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.polar_bear.desc", "Polar Bears live in snowy areas, with adult individuals being aggressive and protecting their cubs.", "北极熊生活在雪地，成年个体具有攻击性，会保护幼崽。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.pufferfish.desc", "Pufferfish inflate when threatened, and their toxins can be used to make potions.", "河豚受到威胁时会膨胀，其毒素可用于制作药水。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.rabbit.desc", "Rabbits are wild animals good at jumping and can be a source of food.", "兔子是擅长跳跃的野生动物，可作为食物来源。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.ravager.desc", "Ravagers are mounts of illagers with strong attack power and health.", "劫掠兽是灾厄村民的坐骑，具有强大的攻击力和生命值。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.salmon.desc", "Salmon are fish that swim upstream and can be cooked into delicious food.", "鲑鱼是会逆流而上的鱼类，可烹饪为美味的食物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.sheep.desc", "Sheep are farm animals that provide wool, which can be dyed and used to make cloth.", "羊是提供羊毛的农场动物，羊毛可染色并用于制作布料。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.shulker.desc", "Shulkers are creatures in the End that disguise themselves as blocks and shoot bullets to make players float.", "潜影贝是末路之地中的生物，会伪装成方块并发射子弹使玩家漂浮。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.silverfish.desc", "Silverfish are small hostile mobs that hide in stones and summon companions when attacked.", "蠹虫是小型敌对生物，会躲藏在石头中，受到攻击时会召唤同伴。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.skeleton.desc", "Who needs muscles, skin, or even eyeballs? Skeletons get by with just the bones on their back, just as deadly as more fleshy foes.", "谁说非得有肌肉、皮肤甚至眼球？骷髅仅凭身上的骨头就能行动，杀伤力不亚于有肉体的敌人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.skeleton_horse.desc", "Skeleton Horses are undead creatures, usually spawned during thunderstorms and can be tamed.", "骷髅马是亡灵生物，通常在雷暴中生成，可被驯服。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.slime.desc", "Slimes are jelly-like hostile mobs that jump to attack and split into smaller slimes when killed.", "史莱姆是果冻状的敌对生物，会跳跃攻击，被杀死后会分裂成小史莱姆。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.sniffer.desc", "The Sniffer is an ancient creature that can sniff out seeds buried underground.", "嗅探兽是古老的生物，能嗅出埋藏在地下的种子。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.snow_golem.desc", "Snow Golems are creatures made of snow blocks and pumpkins that throw snowballs to attack enemies.", "雪傀儡是由雪块和南瓜制作的生物，会投掷雪球攻击敌人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.spider.desc", "Spiders are nocturnal hostile mobs that can climb walls and become neutral during the day.", "蜘蛛是夜间活动的敌对生物，能攀爬墙壁，在白天会变得中立。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.squid.desc", "Squids are cephalopods in oceans that squirt ink to escape danger.", "鱿鱼是海洋中的头足类生物，会喷墨来躲避危险。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.stray.desc", "Strays are skeleton variants in snowy areas that shoot arrows with slowness effect.", "流浪者是雪地中的骷髅变种，会发射带有迟缓效果的箭。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.strider.desc", "Striders are creatures in the Nether that can walk on lava and serve as mounts.", "炽足兽是下界中能在熔岩上行走的生物，可作为坐骑。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.tadpole.desc", "Tadpoles are the larvae of frogs that live in water and gradually develop into adults.", "蝌蚪是青蛙的幼体，生活在水中，会逐渐发育为成体。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.trader_llama.desc", "Trader Llamas are creatures that follow Wandering Traders and can be tamed and equipped.", "行商羊驼是跟随流浪商人的生物，可被驯服和装备。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.tropical_fish.desc", "Tropical Fish are colorful marine creatures that can be kept as ornamental pets.", "热带鱼是色彩斑斓的海洋生物，可作为装饰性宠物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.turtle.desc", "These slow, stoic creatures travel between lakes and dry land, carrying a hard shell on their backs for protection.", "喜欢咸水和海洋猎物的软壳爬行动物。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.vex.desc", "Vexes are small flying hostile mobs summoned by Evokers that can pass through walls.", "恼鬼是由唤魔者召唤的小型飞行敌对生物，能穿过墙壁。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.villager.desc", "Villagers are humans living in villages who can trade with players.", "村民是居住在村庄中的人类，可与玩家进行交易。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.vindicator.desc", "Vindicators are hostile illagers that attack players with axes.", "卫道士是敌对的灾厄村民，会挥舞斧头攻击玩家。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.wandering_trader.desc", "Wandering Traders appear randomly in the world and sell rare items.", "流浪商人会随机出现在世界中，出售稀有物品。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.warden.desc", "The Warden is a powerful creature deep in caves that senses players through sound and vibrations.", "监守者是深藏在洞穴中的强大生物，通过声音和震动感知玩家。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.witch.desc", "Witches are hostile mobs that attack players with various potions and drop potion ingredients.", "女巫是使用各种药水攻击玩家的敌对生物，会掉落药水材料。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.wither.desc", "The Wither can only be summoned by players and shoots Wither Skulls to cause large-scale damage.", "凋灵只能由玩家所召唤，会发射凋灵之首并造成大范围破坏。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.wither_skeleton.desc", "Wither Skeletons are hostile mobs in Nether fortresses that cause wither effect.", "凋灵骷髅是下界堡垒中的敌对生物，会造成凋零效果。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.wolf.desc", "Wolves are tamable creatures that become loyal companions after taming and help attack enemies.", "狼是可驯服的生物，驯服后会成为忠诚的伙伴，帮助攻击敌人。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.zoglin.desc", "Zoglins are hoglins infected with the zombie virus and are aggressive.", "僵尸疣猪兽是被僵尸病毒感染的疣猪兽，具有攻击性。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.zombie.desc", "Leaving doors open may be an invitation for shambling brain-eaters to enter the home, and nobody likes that.", "敞着门可能会让蹒跚的食脑僵尸闯入家中，没人愿意遇到这种事。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.zombie.frozen.desc", "Zombies found in snow biomes are often found bundled up in winter clothing. It doesn't help them any, they are still dead cold!", "在雪原生物群系中发现的僵尸，往往裹着冬衣。但这对它们毫无用处——它们依旧是冰冷的尸体！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.zombie.pink_frozen.desc", "Zombies found in snow biomes are often found bundled up in winter clothing. It doesn't help them any, they are still dead cold!", "在雪原生物群系中发现的僵尸，往往裹着冬衣。但这对它们毫无用处——它们依旧是冰冷的尸体！");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.zombie.raincoat.desc", "Some zombies never leave home without their trusty raincoat. Comfy and dry, they pursue human flesh no matter the weather.", "有些僵尸出门必穿可靠的雨衣，无论天气如何，它们都会在舒适干爽的状态下追逐人肉。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.zombie.slime.desc", "Sometimes, a slime's victim will turn into a zombie mid-digestion. Walking around like that is quite awkward for both parties.", "有时，史莱姆的猎物在被消化的过程中会变成僵尸。这样“半消化半僵尸”地四处游荡，对双方来说都很尴尬。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.zombie_villager.desc", "Zombie Villagers are infected villagers that can be cured with a Weakness potion and a Golden Apple.", "僵尸村民是被感染的村民，可通过虚弱药水和金苹果治愈。");
        language.add("bestiary.entity.minecraft.zombified_piglin.desc", "Zombified Piglins are neutral mobs in the Nether that counterattack in groups when attacked.", "僵尸猪灵是下界的中立生物，被攻击时会群体反击。");
        language.add("bestiary.sort_type.attack", "Attack", "攻击");
        language.add("bestiary.sort_type.bestiary_id", "Bestiary ID", "怪物图鉴ID");
        language.add("bestiary.sort_type.coins", "Coins", "钱币");
